      避免排序键为 PlaceHolderVar 时规划器失败（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5fb5bef3e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f6642a97f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      根据所选计划的形状，此类情况可能产生错误结果，也可能报出<quote>variable not found in subplan target lists</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [f40028994] 2026-10-29 11:27:12 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [4567d170f] 2026-10-29 11:28:08 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [27a53c857] 2026-10-29 11:28:39 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [ba7127f24] 2026-10-29 11:29:08 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [78bc3b96c] 2026-10-29 11:29:34 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复重新结合外连接后错误丢弃外连接子句的问题（Richard Guo，Nitin Motiani）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;27a53c857">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [372761e05] 2026-10-07 14:35:01 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [618130028] 2026-10-07 14:36:24 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [53b058d3b] 2026-10-07 14:37:42 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [0c4235013] 2026-10-07 14:38:42 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [f73794bc1] 2026-10-07 14:39:41 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免整行 Var 引用一个连接并出现在外连接下方时发生<quote>unsupported join alias expression</quote>错误（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;53b058d3b">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [bfa1a69ed] 2026-10-04 12:06:24 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [3ad05dea1] 2026-10-04 12:07:30 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [7a776fc9d] 2026-10-04 12:08:11 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [6c0698339] 2026-10-04 12:08:45 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [6bd71489d] 2026-10-04 12:09:20 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [5a7312587] 2026-10-04 12:09:57 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [10717fe15] 2026-10-04 12:10:33 +0900
-->
     <para>
      在展开整行连接别名引用时正确处理 SubLink（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7a776fc9d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一遗漏导致<quote>cannot handle unplanned sub-select</quote>或<quote>unrecognized node type</quote>等错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [89e06d782] 2026-10-14 16:38:15 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [cbcccca71] 2026-10-14 16:38:15 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [ebf82fae6] 2026-10-14 16:38:15 -0400
-->
     <para>
      不再对继承树执行自连接消除（Tender Wang）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ebf82fae6">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在传统表继承中，父表上的唯一索引不足以证明其所有子表中的唯一性，因此无法完成自连接消除（SJE）所需的证明。此外，该代码还会合并 <literal>parent_table</literal> 和 <literal>parent_table ONLY</literal>，而二者甚至不表示同一组行。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [8f2b598b4] 2026-10-15 12:42:45 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [86ce68d9e] 2026-10-15 12:42:45 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [10b2d9986] 2026-10-15 12:42:46 -0400
-->
     <para>
      在自连接消除中，检查用于证明唯一性的子句是否确实匹配（Tender Wang）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;10b2d9986">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此前，此代码假定操作数相同的相等子句彼此等价，但它们实际上可能使用不同的相等操作符，更常见的是使用不同的排序规则。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [1bf74c806] 2026-08-25 10:16:58 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [d446ca2c4] 2026-08-25 10:18:18 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [4c66f172a] 2026-08-25 10:19:22 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [a4eb938b3] 2026-08-25 10:20:00 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [8fc5b57ae] 2026-08-25 10:20:38 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [201f7192e] 2026-08-25 10:22:12 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [7e29fcd1a] 2026-08-25 10:23:02 +0900
-->
     <para>
      当子查询的目标列表含有任何集合返回函数时，不再假定 <literal>DISTINCT ON</literal> 能确保子查询输出行的唯一性（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4c66f172a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一假定不成立，因为集合返回函数可能在去重步骤之后求值。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [e17df18a8] 2026-09-14 17:03:41 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [acd8d3e0f] 2026-09-14 17:05:29 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [29aef0f68] 2026-09-14 17:07:17 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [23088673d] 2026-09-14 17:08:17 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [27ef9097b] 2026-09-14 17:09:12 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复带有常量测试表达式的简单形式 <literal>CASE</literal> 内部、带 <literal>RETURNING</literal> 子句的 <literal>JSON</literal> 构造器被错误地进行常量折叠的问题（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;29aef0f68">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [264ddc9a6] 2026-09-02 15:32:54 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [a3bc7f2c0] 2026-09-02 15:33:37 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [dd7c135bb] 2026-09-02 15:34:18 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复将 <literal>WHERE</literal> 子句下推到采用不同等价规则的分组步骤之前时的检查（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dd7c135bb">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      上一轮版本发布对此情况的修复，在某些涉及 <literal>CASE</literal> 表达式的子句上行为不正确。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [32872d0c9] 2026-09-18 11:02:10 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [0d5505a22] 2026-09-18 11:02:10 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [720d3df25] 2026-09-18 11:02:10 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [70d0ac3c9] 2026-09-18 11:02:10 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [a91d664d5] 2026-09-18 11:02:10 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [47c43ffda] 2026-09-18 11:02:10 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [d98b99b2a] 2026-09-18 11:02:10 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复查询指定 <literal>FETCH ... WITH TIES</literal> 时 <literal>MIN()</literal>/<literal>MAX()</literal> 索引扫描的错误行为（Chaitanya Choudhary）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;720d3df25">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      <literal>WITH TIES</literal> 选项被意外复制到为执行索引扫描而生成的子 SELECT 中，可能触发<quote>more than one row returned by a subquery used as an expression</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [d237a7a83] 2026-09-16 13:09:15 +0300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [0d5621890] 2026-09-16 13:10:03 +0300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [1ac292cb1] 2026-09-16 12:31:02 +0300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [a10d14afc] 2026-09-16 12:44:20 +0300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [a9c9c4f76] 2026-09-16 12:44:32 +0300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [db0208bfc] 2026-09-16 12:45:13 +0300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [b8e0b45ab] 2026-09-16 12:45:21 +0300
-->
     <para>
      对半连接右侧去重时使用正确的排序规则（Andrey Rachitskiy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1ac292cb1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此问题只在连接比较子句使用非确定性排序规则时发生，因为所有确定性排序规则对字符串相等性的判断都一致。但在此情况下，可能产生包含过多行的错误结果。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [de5659440] 2026-08-28 15:03:54 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [15ccc2041] 2026-08-28 15:04:49 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [718f28167] 2026-08-28 15:05:35 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复单子节点 Append 节点下方被禁用的计划节点类型的处理（Tender Wang）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;718f28167">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      Append 节点未复制其子节点的 disabled_nodes 计数，因而可能优先于其他不包含被禁用节点的候选计划被选中。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
Branch: master [fb60892f4] 2026-09-15 11:47:05 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [e7006ecae] 2026-09-15 11:47:06 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6567f3f1f] 2026-09-15 11:47:07 +0100
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [5b4ebfbfa] 2026-09-15 11:47:08 +0100
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [80c9a58b4] 2026-09-15 11:47:09 +0100
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [cbd2406d0] 2026-09-15 11:47:10 +0100
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [5b6b83cb7] 2026-09-15 11:47:11 +0100
Branch: master [76e9e44b0] 2026-11-04 19:45:39 +0000
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2980e5e4d] 2026-11-04 19:45:39 +0000
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [558c00f96] 2026-11-04 19:45:41 +0000
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [0d83f9e0e] 2026-11-04 19:45:42 +0000
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [b76127a88] 2026-11-04 19:45:43 +0000
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [2c4871093] 2026-11-04 19:45:44 +0000
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [83efe9602] 2026-11-04 19:45:45 +0000
-->
     <para>
      在 <literal>INSERT ... ON CONFLICT</literal> 期间对冲突行获取谓词锁（Zsolt Parragi，Andrey Borodin）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6567f3f1f">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;558c00f96">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此前未这样做，导致可串行化模式下行为不正确，允许本应以串行化错误失败的并发更新。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
Branch: master [bad882987] 2026-09-14 16:55:14 +0200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [05c4b10fc] 2026-09-14 16:55:09 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [937a0e68c] 2026-09-14 16:47:51 +0200
-->
     <para>
      修复并行构建 GIN 索引时的整数溢出（Ewan Young）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;937a0e68c">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      索引键存储在一个大小字段仅为 16 位的中间数据结构中，因此大于 65535 字节的键会被截断，导致崩溃或索引项损坏。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [6e5d5680b] 2026-08-28 13:10:21 +1200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [7a74e5ed9] 2026-08-28 13:10:56 +1200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [7c503d683] 2026-08-28 13:11:23 +1200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [2d8494e24] 2026-08-28 13:11:46 +1200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [a0396c8e3] 2026-08-28 13:12:12 +1200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [1a501b6e2] 2026-08-28 13:12:40 +1200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [978caef19] 2026-08-28 13:13:04 +1200
-->
     <para>
      修复不正确的多列 <literal>RANGE</literal> 分区剪枝（David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7c503d683">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      对 <literal>RANGE</literal> 分区表执行分区剪枝时，如果裁剪限定条件仅涉及分区键的一个前导前缀，分区剪枝可能移除一些不应被裁剪的分区（导致漏掉本应找到的行），也可能包含一些不需要的分区。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [b9d9e9bcc] 2026-09-18 17:14:21 +1200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [73b0b18f1] 2026-09-18 17:14:59 +1200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [63d9e26c2] 2026-09-18 17:15:30 +1200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [d21d4f1ca] 2026-09-18 17:15:52 +1200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [1d8a93336] 2026-09-18 17:16:22 +1200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [9b8c0f238] 2026-09-18 17:16:47 +1200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [3d734a059] 2026-09-18 17:17:13 +1200
-->
     <para>
      修复使用 <literal>MINVALUE</literal> 或 <literal>MAXVALUE</literal> 边界的范围分区表中错误剪枝 <literal>DEFAULT</literal> 分区的问题（Ewan Young）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;63d9e26c2">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在某些情况下，代码会错误地认定无需扫描 <literal>DEFAULT</literal> 分区，从而漏掉一些本应匹配查询的行。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [1b5dd3a24] 2026-10-09 11:03:07 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2359968b4] 2026-10-09 11:03:53 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [c7328770b] 2026-10-09 11:04:22 +1300
Branch: master [73e69062c] 2026-10-15 15:49:06 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [9b505ef6c] 2026-10-15 15:49:43 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [57193b3a0] 2026-10-15 15:50:11 +1300
-->
     <para>
      修复 EPQ 重新检查期间对运行时分区剪枝的不当处理（David Rowley，Zsolt Parragi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c7328770b">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;57193b3a0">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此错误可能悄然跳过本应更新的行，也可能导致释放后使用内存的访问。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [eacee6b61] 2026-10-14 14:54:45 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [3f807d6e9] 2026-10-14 14:55:25 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [70ffc30e1] 2026-10-14 14:56:08 +0900
-->
     <para>
      不在计划启动时的分区剪枝中使用包含 SubPlan 的表达式（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;70ffc30e1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这可以避免边界情况下的<quote>SubPlan found with no parent plan</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [b715192e5] 2026-11-05 10:21:17 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [1c2ba4df3] 2026-11-05 10:21:17 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [bfbb3d842] 2026-11-05 10:21:17 +1300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [9171fca99] 2026-11-05 10:21:17 +1300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [0500fb3ab] 2026-11-05 10:21:17 +1300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [6e8605116] 2026-11-05 10:21:17 +1300
Branch: master [edbe7ffdc] 2026-11-06 20:18:18 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [1c087e616] 2026-11-06 20:18:18 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [744ca40cb] 2026-11-06 20:18:18 +1300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [2a3ac1554] 2026-11-06 20:18:18 +1300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [1d57f6ef7] 2026-11-06 20:18:18 +1300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [21a53865f] 2026-11-06 20:18:18 +1300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [f72e4686e] 2026-11-06 20:18:18 +1300
-->
     <para>
      修复查询对同一列应用多个排序键时的问题（David Rowley，Ayush Tiwari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bfbb3d842">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;744ca40cb">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      某些查询可能使后端进程崩溃，其他情况下则会忽略附加的排序指定。通常这些附加指定确实是冗余的，因为第一个指定就能完全确定结果顺序。但使用非确定性排序规则，或查询使用不同的 <literal>ORDER BY</literal> 操作符时，并不一定如此。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [303c9b362] 2026-11-02 14:36:38 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [24796e334] 2026-11-02 14:37:22 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5b730e81f] 2026-11-02 14:38:32 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [fcb44c5e5] 2026-11-02 14:39:11 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [06e46b651] 2026-11-02 14:40:19 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [f5b8f05ee] 2026-11-02 14:40:58 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [40a5aa4a7] 2026-11-02 14:41:27 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [9d0081c01] 2026-11-02 15:40:50 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [25b55788d] 2026-11-02 15:41:23 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [1e9c734c2] 2026-11-02 15:41:59 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [064281150] 2026-11-02 15:42:37 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [56fb8ee6e] 2026-11-02 15:43:17 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免在多个位置引用哈希 SubPlan 时可能复用过时哈希表的问题（Rahul Yadav）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5b730e81f">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9d0081c01">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [352734540] 2026-11-04 13:43:17 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [0e58f6d73] 2026-11-04 13:43:17 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [9dd027535] 2026-11-04 13:43:17 +1300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [f79bf8d8f] 2026-11-04 13:43:17 +1300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [083d60e34] 2026-11-04 13:43:17 +1300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [2da9b7f9b] 2026-11-04 13:43:17 +1300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [e22cec1bd] 2026-11-04 13:43:17 +1300
-->
     <para>
      确保 Memoize 计划节点使用正确的输入排序规则（Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9dd027535">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这只在使用非确定性排序规则时有影响。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [708eb5158] 2026-11-02 10:28:38 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [f39f3f971] 2026-11-02 10:29:54 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [dbe6cf558] 2026-11-02 10:30:52 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [d6f60a031] 2026-11-02 10:31:29 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [b5ad785be] 2026-11-02 10:32:00 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [a7a2cab57] 2026-11-02 10:32:52 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [de7d7d4df] 2026-11-02 10:33:24 +0900
Branch: master [45ff0b4a3] 2026-11-03 09:45:51 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [0fd0e501a] 2026-11-03 09:46:54 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [2bcf2fa49] 2026-11-03 09:48:38 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [db7e885d0] 2026-11-03 09:49:37 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [f1d27a922] 2026-11-03 09:50:13 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [025dac1c9] 2026-11-03 09:51:10 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [63e261b0b] 2026-11-03 09:51:48 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 Param 是缓存键的子表达式时 Memoize 计划返回错误结果的问题（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dbe6cf558">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2bcf2fa49">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [8b9ffcb11] 2026-10-14 22:06:30 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [a345db783] 2026-10-14 22:07:25 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [0aba37abf] 2026-10-14 22:07:53 +1300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [04609efb3] 2026-10-14 22:08:21 +1300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [0896fb027] 2026-10-14 22:08:46 +1300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [bd811277c] 2026-10-14 22:09:10 +1300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [3d6e24626] 2026-10-14 22:09:32 +1300
-->
     <para>
      修复 Gather 下方的 Memoize 计划节点丢失并行工作进程统计信息的问题（Tatsuya Kawata）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0aba37abf">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      <command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command> 只报告了自上次重新扫描 Gather 以来的统计信息。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
Branch: master [2866d8c7d] 2026-08-27 14:31:44 +0300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ba12a202c] 2026-08-27 14:31:58 +0300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [b90eeb29e] 2026-08-27 14:32:07 +0300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [b62206043] 2026-08-27 14:32:09 +0300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [e5e841cc5] 2026-08-27 14:32:11 +0300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [b76b966c2] 2026-08-27 14:32:13 +0300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [ba2ea49b3] 2026-08-27 14:35:12 +0300
-->
     <para>
      如果函数定义使用数组或类型修饰符语法指定未知的返回类型名称，则不创建 shell 类型（Heikki Linnakangas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b90eeb29e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此类情况显然是错误，因为在对类型进行任何高级操作之前，应先创建该类型。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
Branch: master [79b101486] 2026-08-26 15:38:17 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ef89c839c] 2026-08-26 15:38:15 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [74c9832ca] 2026-08-26 15:38:13 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [2ae67ada7] 2026-08-26 15:38:11 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [d03ff3b75] 2026-08-26 15:38:09 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [ea3227bf2] 2026-08-26 15:38:07 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [9a1fa1f36] 2026-08-26 15:38:04 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复快照导出和导入，使其能够正确处理恢复期间取得的快照（Peter Geoghegan，Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;74c9832ca">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此类快照的数据布局不同，但导出/导入逻辑并不知道这一点，导致导入的快照行为不正确。这不仅会使导入事务返回错误结果，还可能因错误设置提示位而造成持久的数据损坏。
     </para>

     <para>
      已知在备库上运行并行 <application>pg_dump</application> 会触发此错误。在这种情况下，它可能同时损坏转储输出和备库的数据。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
Branch: master [0ebeec35f] 2026-08-20 19:47:32 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ca99016f9] 2026-08-20 19:47:31 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [3977cde27] 2026-08-20 19:47:29 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [24bf23fe6] 2026-08-20 19:47:27 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [7a392b0f6] 2026-08-20 19:47:25 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [4afe4b564] 2026-08-20 19:47:23 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [e94ba903b] 2026-08-20 19:47:21 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复事务快照导入中的原子性问题（Chee Wooson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3977cde27">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      曾存在一个时间窗口，使其他观察者可能无法看到源事务仍在运行，这可能导致 <command>VACUUM</command> 等作出错误判断。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [142fd8ff1] 2026-09-26 09:28:12 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [aa60617b6] 2026-09-26 09:28:15 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [753057e34] 2026-09-26 09:28:18 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复导入范围类型、多范围类型或 <type>tsvector</type> 上的域类型列的统计信息时的问题（Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;753057e34">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      恢复逻辑在检查这些数据类型专用统计信息类型的适用性时，未能透过域检查底层类型。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [35b349a53] 2026-10-29 10:38:48 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [1ecc3cee7] 2026-10-29 10:38:40 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6cb715e2d] 2026-10-29 10:38:34 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [8793978e3] 2026-10-29 10:38:24 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复对 <literal>JSON_TABLE</literal> 中 <literal>PASSING</literal> 参数重复进行解析转换的问题（Ayush Tiwari，Amit Langote）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6cb715e2d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一错误导致<quote>unexpected non-SELECT command in SubLink</quote>等意外失败。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [e405a46c4] 2026-11-06 16:20:27 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [3d72e63b8] 2026-11-06 16:20:14 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [c7656ac9e] 2026-11-06 17:30:24 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [03550d3cf] 2026-11-06 17:29:36 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复未给 <literal>JSON_TABLE</literal> 的 <literal>PASSING</literal> 表达式分配排序规则的问题（Venu Kummari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c7656ac9e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一遗漏可能导致错误结果，或出现<quote>could not determine which collation to use for string comparison</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [ab713cdcd] 2026-09-19 20:13:51 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [fdb88a51c] 2026-09-19 20:13:56 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [b8736db6e] 2026-09-19 20:14:00 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [8bccf0159] 2026-09-19 20:14:03 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复在 <literal>JSON_TABLE</literal> 及相关函数的 <literal>PASSING</literal> 参数中使用经过 TOAST 处理的文本值时的问题（Chaitanya Choudhary，Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b8736db6e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      代码未执行 detoast，导致输出不正确。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [627c4df3b] 2026-11-05 15:27:20 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2f2c923c3] 2026-11-05 15:26:41 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [7150d0fd4] 2026-11-05 15:26:26 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [31af62f38] 2026-11-05 12:42:28 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <literal>JSON_VALUE() RETURNING</literal> <type>json</type>/<type>jsonb</type> 中 NULL 结果持续保留的问题（Srinath Reddy Sadipiralla）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7150d0fd4">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      返回 <type>json</type> 或 <type>jsonb</type> 值的 <literal>JSON_VALUE(... RETURNING ...)</literal> 一旦返回 NULL，同一语句中后续对同一表达式的每次求值也都会返回 NULL，无论是否应当如此。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [ee7cfb99a] 2026-11-05 08:54:19 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [8e5c3d3db] 2026-11-05 08:55:05 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [52033b887] 2026-11-05 08:55:23 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [775e03191] 2026-11-05 08:55:39 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <literal>JSON_VALUE</literal> 和相关结构中 <literal>ON EMPTY/ERROR</literal> 结果持续保留的问题（Jian He，Andrey Rachitskiy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;52033b887">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      NULL 输入可能导致返回前一行的 <literal>ON EMPTY / ON ERROR</literal> 表达式的值。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [17b4e9963] 2026-10-29 09:24:21 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [6839997e3] 2026-10-29 09:24:07 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5209a736a] 2026-10-29 09:23:53 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [6dfe31d48] 2026-10-29 09:23:00 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <literal>SQL/JSON</literal> 操作中 <literal>DEFAULT</literal> 表达式失败的处理（Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5209a736a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      执行 <literal>DEFAULT</literal> 表达式时发生的错误可能被忽略，转而产生 NULL 结果。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [b6e41c16f] 2026-10-29 09:59:35 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [67f375edb] 2026-10-29 09:59:22 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [b9a415360] 2026-10-29 09:59:08 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [46798ab1a] 2026-10-29 09:58:54 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <literal>SQL/JSON</literal> 操作中域强制转换失败的处理（Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b9a415360">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在 <literal>ON ERROR</literal> 或 <literal>ON EMPTY</literal> 子句指定了某种非报错行为的情况下，<literal>SQL/JSON</literal> 查询函数可能仍抛出错误，或报告了不正确的错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [1b0b45c5a] 2026-10-24 14:27:12 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [d44852026] 2026-10-24 14:27:12 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [65f3b7096] 2026-10-24 14:27:12 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [19656b77d] 2026-10-24 14:27:12 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [0cf2c7e38] 2026-10-24 14:27:12 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [3b2a60481] 2026-10-24 14:27:12 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [327c5f0e6] 2026-10-24 14:27:12 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复严格 <type>jsonpath</type> 查询中对普通标量字符串的 GIN 索引搜索（Rui Zhao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;65f3b7096">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      对 <literal>strict $ == "scalar"</literal> 之类的 <type>jsonpath</type> 执行 <literal>jsonb_ops</literal> 索引扫描时，未能找到值仅为 <literal>"scalar"</literal> 的表项。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [b28a2b2bf] 2026-10-13 16:33:35 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [5146b3f75] 2026-10-13 16:33:35 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [154e2f101] 2026-10-13 16:33:35 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [65f1b71c3] 2026-10-13 16:33:35 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [c138ab8a9] 2026-10-13 16:33:35 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [04a8915fa] 2026-10-13 16:33:35 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [d987ad61d] 2026-10-13 16:33:35 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复从 jsonpath 查询提取 GIN 索引扫描条件时的错误（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;154e2f101">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      <literal>NOT</literal> 操作符下方的 <literal>AND</literal> 操作符可能被错误实现。此外，对字面常量应用方法（例如 <literal>"42".double()</literal>）也未得到正确处理。这些错误不会产生可见的报错，但 GIN 索引搜索会漏掉部分或全部本应匹配的行。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: John Naylor <john.naylor@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [328a9a173] 2026-10-30 12:31:39 +0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [b0d482b33] 2026-10-30 12:31:39 +0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [03ba8e591] 2026-10-30 12:31:39 +0700
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [9ad421a9b] 2026-10-30 12:31:39 +0700
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [9cba87fe9] 2026-10-30 12:31:39 +0700
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [0496d85f9] 2026-10-30 12:31:39 +0700
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [9e3077ff4] 2026-10-30 12:31:39 +0700
-->
     <para>
      修复 SP-GiST 四叉树 <literal>&lt;@</literal> 搜索中的边界情况错误（John Naylor）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;03ba8e591">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      由于舍入误差，搜索有时可能不会进入需要搜索的象限，导致查询结果不完整。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: John Naylor <john.naylor@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [eab68b1be] 2026-10-14 18:19:39 +0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [845725890] 2026-10-14 18:19:39 +0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [fc834ccab] 2026-10-14 18:19:39 +0700
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [3d8c50317] 2026-10-14 18:19:39 +0700
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [235e15ec7] 2026-10-14 18:19:39 +0700
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [37ecbb438] 2026-10-14 18:19:39 +0700
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [0e9544439] 2026-10-14 18:19:39 +0700
-->
     <para>
      修复 SP-GiST 四叉树索引在边界情况下的失败（Ayush Tiwari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fc834ccab">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      舍入误差可能使搜索和插入报出<quote>getQuadrant: impossible case</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [3c5a4a867] 2026-10-22 13:51:27 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [0d0d2a13e] 2026-10-22 13:51:27 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6c4172b34] 2026-10-22 13:51:27 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [e05b7e2a4] 2026-10-22 13:51:27 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [774c47de1] 2026-10-22 13:51:27 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [187051f85] 2026-10-22 13:51:27 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [264c441c4] 2026-10-22 13:51:27 -0400
-->
     <para>
      在二进制输入中接受空 <type>tsquery</type> 值（Ayush Tiwari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c4172b34">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      其他位置允许空 <type>tsquery</type> 值，但 <function>tsqueryrecv()</function> 此前会失败。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [e6cac7fab] 2026-08-17 18:09:07 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [1c732c851] 2026-08-17 18:09:07 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [69915dac4] 2026-08-17 18:09:07 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [91989795d] 2026-08-17 18:09:07 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [cdffe3375] 2026-08-17 18:09:07 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [df8b91463] 2026-08-17 18:09:07 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [05556bdf9] 2026-08-17 18:09:07 -0400
-->
     <para>
      在 <type>tsquery</type> 值的二进制输入中禁止零长度词位和超出范围的短语距离值（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;69915dac4">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      文本输入中已拒绝这些情况，但 <function>tsqueryrecv()</function> 遗漏了等效检查，因而接受了后续无法转储/重新载入的值。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [fe5a01097] 2026-10-05 15:45:40 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [cb600aae3] 2026-10-05 15:45:40 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [90cc09f57] 2026-10-05 15:45:40 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [ffbe37115] 2026-10-05 15:45:40 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [d4fae2993] 2026-10-05 15:45:40 -0400
-->
     <para>
      在 <type>tsquery</type> 和 <type>ltxtquery</type> 输入中，将操作符嵌套过深的错误视为软错误（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;90cc09f57">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [957d4eae5] 2026-08-13 11:20:27 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [5185e64ae] 2026-08-13 11:20:27 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [a68beda42] 2026-08-13 11:20:27 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [b42d0c310] 2026-08-13 11:20:27 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [1fc1b82b2] 2026-08-13 11:20:27 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [ef9063a88] 2026-08-13 11:20:27 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [39cad0de4] 2026-08-13 11:20:27 -0400
-->
     <para>
      在 <type>tsvector</type> 和 <type>tsquery</type> 中一致地执行最大长度限制（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a68beda42">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      有些位置认为词位最大长度是 <literal>MAXSTRLEN</literal>（2047），另一些位置则认为是 <literal>MAXSTRLEN-1</literal>。幸运的是，较宽松的边界才是正确的，因此现在统一使用 <literal>MAXSTRLEN</literal>。同样，对于数据总长度上限 <literal>MAXSTRPOS</literal>，有些位置的限制比其他位置更严格。这些修复避免了合法构造的值无法转储/重新载入的情况。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [a63df2664] 2026-09-01 10:13:30 +0200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2291b6ffb] 2026-09-01 10:13:30 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [bfb08d094] 2026-09-01 10:13:30 +0200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [3103bdafd] 2026-09-01 10:15:35 +0200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [48af47dcd] 2026-09-01 10:13:30 +0200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [729bac9eb] 2026-09-01 10:13:30 +0200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [858fb27b6] 2026-09-01 10:13:30 +0200
-->
     <para>
      修复长度参数为 <literal>INT_MIN</literal>（-2147483648）时的 <function>right()</function>（Ewan Young）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bfb08d094">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      由于整数溢出，该函数在本应返回空字符串时返回了整个字符串。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
