-->
     <para>
      修复 <function>pg_blocking_pids()</function>，使其正确计入关系扩展锁（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dc60d6aa1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [66042bd3e] 2026-10-22 14:39:03 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2dc899f78] 2026-10-22 14:39:06 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [58998c33d] 2026-10-22 14:39:09 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [8af1a12c9] 2026-10-22 14:39:11 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [6f126b328] 2026-10-22 14:39:13 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [e4ac00514] 2026-10-22 14:39:15 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [5259332a6] 2026-10-22 14:39:17 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <function>pg_indexam_progress_phasename()</function> 中混淆 32 位与 64 位的问题（Markos Fountoulakis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;58998c33d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此函数碰巧能在常见硬件上正常工作，但在 32 位或大端平台上可能行为异常。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [3b120b1e9] 2026-09-01 11:42:13 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [9efc2f9d8] 2026-09-01 11:42:50 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [ec434db1f] 2026-09-01 11:42:56 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [04c25af21] 2026-09-01 11:43:01 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [55af98a45] 2026-09-01 11:43:08 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [772251744] 2026-09-01 11:43:13 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [f1c6f7ec9] 2026-09-01 11:43:22 +0900
-->
     <para>
      检测 <function>to_char()</function> 使用 <literal>V</literal> 格式时的整数溢出（Andrey Rachitskiy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ec434db1f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      如果数据值为整数，且将其乘以 <literal>V</literal> 格式所隐含的 10 的幂会导致整数溢出，<function>to_char()</function> 此前会悄然输出错误数字。现在改为抛出整数溢出错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [252432c4c] 2026-11-02 21:49:31 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [9a1d7f3a6] 2026-11-02 21:51:03 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [1be7010d1] 2026-11-02 21:51:08 +0100
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [c83ddfcfe] 2026-11-02 21:51:12 +0100
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [7e0d03a91] 2026-11-02 21:51:16 +0100
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [6a770f537] 2026-11-02 21:51:21 +0100
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [c48577385] 2026-11-02 21:51:26 +0100
-->
     <para>
      避免计算 <type>tid</type> 值的 BRIN minmax_multi 距离时发生整数溢出（Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1be7010d1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      很大的 <type>tid</type> 值可能产生负距离，最终使索引效率低下，但并不会实际损坏索引。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [c230e14b4] 2026-11-02 21:42:53 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [78721a206] 2026-11-02 20:11:54 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5c8629bb5] 2026-11-02 20:43:20 +0100
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [9ab2a624e] 2026-11-02 20:48:02 +0100
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [444b85032] 2026-11-02 20:52:23 +0100
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [b8d5b9a01] 2026-11-02 20:56:46 +0100
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [174b605f0] 2026-11-02 21:20:09 +0100
-->
     <para>
      避免计算 numeric 值的 BRIN minmax_multi 距离时溢出，并正确处理 NaN（Kirill Reshke，Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5c8629bb5">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这些遗漏可能导致报错（阻止索引汇总），或使索引效率低下。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [d06ac896f] 2026-11-05 15:20:20 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [1137ebf22] 2026-11-05 15:20:43 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [8a043da94] 2026-11-05 15:21:03 +0100
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [dfd98ce58] 2026-11-05 15:21:22 +0100
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [5c78685fc] 2026-11-05 15:21:42 +0100
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [10686da4e] 2026-11-05 15:22:03 +0100
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [52f418f1f] 2026-11-05 15:22:25 +0100
-->
     <para>
      避免计算 numeric 范围的差值时溢出（Kirill Reshke）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8a043da94">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在此上下文中，我们希望返回正无穷或负无穷，而不是抛出溢出错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [15ee73d7d] 2026-08-29 19:56:49 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [50daffb06] 2026-08-29 19:56:49 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [1f02a1e48] 2026-08-29 19:56:49 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [e96b27296] 2026-08-29 19:56:49 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [5827ddfc2] 2026-08-29 19:56:49 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [1eca8b94d] 2026-08-29 19:56:49 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [b4c8afdfa] 2026-08-29 19:56:49 -0400
-->
     <para>
      支持 Hunspell 词缀文件中不在预期位置的 <literal>FLAG</literal> 行（Ewan Young）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1f02a1e48">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      Hunspell 词缀文件通常将 <literal>FLAG</literal> 行放在最前面，而我们的实现隐含依赖了这一点。如果它位于某些含义依赖 <literal>FLAG</literal> 设置的行之后，就会导致崩溃或无法匹配复合词。现在修复逻辑，使 <literal>FLAG</literal> 行可以位于任意位置。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [1999fe227] 2026-10-20 17:32:31 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [763f95c63] 2026-10-20 17:32:31 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [4ee8af2e8] 2026-10-20 17:32:31 -0400
Branch: master [896246ea1] 2026-10-23 10:29:45 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [015f4c9fc] 2026-10-23 10:29:45 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [b049b4e7b] 2026-10-23 10:29:45 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复 <command>EXPLAIN</command> 在 <literal>RETURNING</literal> SubPlan 中输出的 <literal>OLD</literal>/<literal>NEW</literal> 别名（Henson Choi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4ee8af2e8">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b049b4e7b">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在涉及多个别名的计划中，可能输出错误的别名，导致输出令人困惑。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [0497318e4] 2026-10-19 17:51:30 -0400
