Branch: REL_15_STABLE [861a9c402] 2026-11-05 08:15:37 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [9e77656a9] 2026-11-05 08:11:17 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复多行 <command>INSERT ... VALUES</command> 在目标列下标中含有子 SELECT 时解析器失败的问题（Amit Langote）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fa0806647">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这会导致<quote>unexpected non-SELECT command in SubLink</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [a14041d43] 2026-10-06 09:04:32 -0500
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [63e33d40b] 2026-10-06 09:04:32 -0500
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [95d960447] 2026-10-06 09:04:32 -0500
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [6b428e47b] 2026-10-06 09:04:32 -0500
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [1955fd0b4] 2026-10-06 09:04:32 -0500
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [1adbe902a] 2026-10-06 09:04:32 -0500
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [c596e189d] 2026-10-06 09:04:32 -0500
-->
     <para>
      修复 <literal>COPY FROM</literal> 中遗漏 <literal>WHERE</literal> 子句预处理的问题（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;95d960447">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一遗漏会在操作符被取反时导致<quote>cache lookup failed for function 0</quote>错误，也很可能影响其他情况。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [700b422af] 2026-10-27 19:46:12 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [a01d1a17e] 2026-10-27 19:46:42 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [35f60e5ce] 2026-10-27 19:47:09 +1300
-->
     <para>
      禁止在分区表上使用 <literal>NOT NULL NO INHERIT</literal> 约束（David Rowley，Nitin Motiani）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;35f60e5ce">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      普通 <command>CREATE TABLE</command> 已拒绝此类约束，但 <command>CREATE TABLE LIKE</command> 等情况未检查复制的约束，可能允许分区包含本不应存在的空值。
     </para>

     <para>
      如果怀疑数据库中可能已发生这种情况，可执行以下命令查找有问题的约束：
<programlisting>
SELECT conrelid::regclass, conname
FROM pg_constraint
WHERE contype = 'n' AND connoinherit
      AND conrelid IN (SELECT oid FROM pg_class WHERE relkind = 'p');
</programlisting>
不需要的约束可用 <literal>ALTER TABLE ... DROP CONSTRAINT ...</literal> 移除，需要保留的约束则应使用 <literal>ALTER TABLE ... ALTER CONSTRAINT ... INHERIT</literal> 修复。如果表的任何分区中存在空值，后一条命令将失败。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [dd97e0c8e] 2026-10-06 13:13:47 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [5e3245401] 2026-10-06 13:14:49 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5659e549a] 2026-10-06 13:14:58 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <command>ALTER TABLE ADD PRIMARY KEY</command> 对已有 NOT NULL 约束的检查（Fujii Masao，Manuel Reyes Bravo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5659e549a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此前，在一条 <command>ALTER TABLE</command> 命令中删除 NOT NULL 列、添加同名新列并将其设为主键，可能报出<quote>primary key column ... is not marked NOT NULL</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
Branch: master [85f55534e] 2026-09-23 09:39:04 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [fe1d5aeff] 2026-09-23 09:39:05 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [ce9bd103e] 2026-09-23 09:39:06 +0100
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [745152e45] 2026-09-23 09:39:07 +0100
-->
     <para>
      修复 <command>MERGE ... WHEN NOT MATCHED BY SOURCE</command> 对并发删除的处理（Tender Wang）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ce9bd103e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在 <command>MERGE</command> 中执行 <literal>WHEN NOT MATCHED BY SOURCE</literal> 动作时，如果目标表的元组被并发删除，重试代码会错误地改为对该行执行 <literal>WHEN NOT MATCHED BY TARGET</literal> 动作，产生不正确的结果。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
Branch: master [a12600b76] 2026-09-09 11:03:39 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [5dec175fb] 2026-09-09 11:06:47 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [d77627daa] 2026-09-09 11:08:39 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [960b6b532] 2026-09-09 11:15:22 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [749dd8d1f] 2026-09-09 11:23:25 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [00126dede] 2026-09-09 11:27:58 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [539b7e829] 2026-09-09 11:32:37 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复与 <command>DROP TABLESPACE</command> 相关的竞态条件（Ayush Tiwari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d77627daa">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      如果 <command>DROP</command> 与尝试向该表空间添加新对象的命令并发执行，最终可能导致系统目录内容不一致。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [1e707d325] 2026-10-21 10:44:03 -0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2f79b0179] 2026-10-21 10:44:06 -0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [794c29dc4] 2026-10-21 10:44:09 -0700
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [17f66a681] 2026-10-21 10:44:12 -0700
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [044887b60] 2026-10-21 10:44:14 -0700
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [c517dbb31] 2026-10-21 10:44:17 -0700
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [599c50d25] 2026-10-21 10:44:20 -0700
Branch: master [fded90eec] 2026-10-21 11:10:35 -0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [702f218cb] 2026-10-21 11:10:38 -0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [a5b925cfc] 2026-10-21 11:10:41 -0700
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [3e53104dc] 2026-10-21 11:10:44 -0700
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [391fded1e] 2026-10-21 11:10:46 -0700
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [7f641940c] 2026-10-21 11:10:49 -0700
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [e16d102a4] 2026-10-21 11:10:52 -0700
-->
     <para>
      在恢复期间明确拒绝对不记录 WAL的表的操作（Jim Jones）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;794c29dc4">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a5b925cfc">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      不记录 WAL的表在备库上没有数据，因此读取它必须失败。多数操作对此会给出恰当错误，但 <command>COPY ... TO</command> 和 <function>currtid2()</function> 此前会报出内部<quote>could not open file</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [a8261c766] 2026-08-13 16:35:07 -0500
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [9db2383e0] 2026-08-13 16:35:07 -0500
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [0468246f5] 2026-08-13 16:35:07 -0500
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [be0076b71] 2026-08-13 16:35:07 -0500
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [dbda203fe] 2026-08-13 16:35:07 -0500
-->
     <para>
      修复角色成员资格变更中不一致的权限检查（ChangAo Chen）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0468246f5">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这修复了本应报告权限不足，却报出内部<quote>no possible grantors</quote>错误的情况。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [3bed1f91a] 2026-09-08 14:09:20 +0300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [d0518cb3e] 2026-09-08 13:32:52 +0300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5d63dbd97] 2026-09-08 13:32:53 +0300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [bee33974e] 2026-09-08 13:32:54 +0300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [a8004e161] 2026-09-08 13:32:55 +0300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [89834e3f2] 2026-09-08 13:32:56 +0300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [35e4b760a] 2026-09-08 13:32:57 +0300
-->
     <para>
      撤销此前对空闲空间映射持久化的更改（Alexander Korotkov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5d63dbd97">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      事实证明，c06d1a4ba 等提交（包含在 2026 年 5 月的版本中）引入的问题比解决的问题更多。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [0b776de09] 2026-09-03 12:12:42 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [e65f21a27] 2026-09-03 12:14:44 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [d2943b94b] 2026-09-03 12:15:17 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [4639b6cfe] 2026-09-03 12:15:23 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [a90cbbc86] 2026-09-03 12:16:05 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [cc1edfa6c] 2026-09-03 12:16:54 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [57c107238] 2026-09-03 12:17:13 +0900
-->
     <para>
      当默认事务模式为 <literal>SERIALIZABLE READ ONLY DEFERRABLE</literal> 时，避免后端进程退出时在临时表清理中挂起（Andrey Rachitskiy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d2943b94b">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      清理会阻塞，直到并发的可串行化事务完成；如果其中一些是预备事务，等待可能无限持续。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [50d6e533e] 2026-10-02 10:43:17 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [7166a1d02] 2026-10-02 10:43:27 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [95f6bfb51] 2026-10-02 10:43:28 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [2affc1964] 2026-10-02 10:43:30 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [caa19f80d] 2026-10-02 10:43:31 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [fc56f1663] 2026-10-02 10:43:33 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [84b86b210] 2026-10-02 10:43:34 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免描述一个游标已经不存在的 <command>FETCH</command> 语句时崩溃（Dirkjan Bussink）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;95f6bfb51">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [85adc584e] 2026-10-06 01:20:57 +1300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [a2148471b] 2026-10-06 01:21:26 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [8d5b228ae] 2026-10-06 01:21:53 +1300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [2414028ab] 2026-10-06 01:22:23 +1300
-->
     <para>
      修复按引用传递的数据类型在datum 排序中的内存计量（Mario Karuza）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8d5b228ae">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此错误可能导致无法正确执行 <varname>work_mem</varname> 限制，或使 <command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command> 输出具有误导性。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
Branch: master [96c99955b] 2026-10-05 13:12:33 +0300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [e7d7e047b] 2026-10-05 13:12:42 +0300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5f671c431] 2026-10-05 13:12:44 +0300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [71d1ace33] 2026-10-05 13:12:45 +0300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [226e86cda] 2026-10-05 13:12:46 +0300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [d40546032] 2026-10-05 13:12:47 +0300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [4a7778ef8] 2026-10-05 13:12:48 +0300
-->
     <para>
      持有锁时若请求清理延迟休眠，则不休眠（Kevin Rocker，Andrey Borodin，Mostafa）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5f671c431">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      同时，将若干已有的延迟调用移到真正可以安全休眠的位置。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [abf5fec63] 2026-10-08 11:26:09 -0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2604c28bf] 2026-10-08 11:26:12 -0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6bfb33088] 2026-10-08 11:26:15 -0700
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [35c508af5] 2026-10-08 11:26:17 -0700
-->
     <para>
      修复并行清理的 I/O 耗时报告（Bharath Rupireddy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6bfb33088">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      <literal>VACUUM VERBOSE</literal> 和自动清理日志包含了并行工作进程读取块和弄脏块的计数，却没有包含其执行这些 I/O 所花费的时间。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [e5f6a7a28] 2026-11-04 15:04:12 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [fbe7033af] 2026-11-04 15:03:58 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [9e9d24c33] 2026-11-04 15:03:44 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [f3ea7cb46] 2026-11-04 15:03:29 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [e37a8075f] 2026-11-04 15:03:15 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [3cb89e214] 2026-11-04 15:02:40 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [bc2125742] 2026-11-04 15:02:04 +0900
-->
     <para>
      如果用于检查外键约束的查询计划仍在使用，则不释放它（Lucas Jeffrey，Trakshan Mishra，Amit Langote）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9e9d24c33">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在刻意构造的情况下可能触发此行为，例如带有执行 DML 的触发器的表上存在自引用的 ON DELETE CASCADE 外键。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [ead8f696b] 2026-08-20 15:17:26 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [386198434] 2026-08-20 15:17:29 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6a1759a02] 2026-08-20 15:17:32 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复崩溃重启期间启动子进程崩溃时 postmaster 未能退出的问题（Zexin Li）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6a1759a02">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在这种情况下，postmaster 应当放弃并退出，但此前没有这样做，而是陷入停滞。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [803583ce7] 2026-08-17 08:53:22 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [13967fe0e] 2026-08-17 08:53:24 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [0391fee2d] 2026-08-17 08:53:29 +0900
-->
     <para>
      解析 GUC 文件时更谨慎地处理扫描器失败（Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0391fee2d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [e352ac8c5] 2026-11-05 14:14:01 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [c38de3ae6] 2026-11-05 14:14:01 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [8e54a4145] 2026-11-05 14:14:01 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [dcf112bd4] 2026-11-06 00:49:07 +0100
-->
     <para>
      在 OAuth 认证期间重新检查 <varname>oauth_validator_libraries</varname>（Zsolt Parragi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8e54a4145">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dcf112bd4">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一新增检查确保对 <varname>oauth_validator_libraries</varname> 的更改立即生效。此前，如果此类更改使 <filename>pg_hba.conf</filename> 中已有的 <literal>oauth</literal> 行失效，新设置要等到该情况被修复后才会执行。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [bca67e5a3] 2026-09-17 14:52:30 +0200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [1d094904b] 2026-09-17 14:52:30 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [99c3f5e20] 2026-09-17 14:52:30 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [459ef520d] 2026-09-17 14:56:28 +0200
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [f1eafd911] 2026-10-08 10:58:07 -0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [08f24a115] 2026-10-08 10:58:14 -0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [af28fc13e] 2026-10-08 10:58:18 -0700
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [8cb6b83e1] 2026-11-05 21:43:55 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [9f7d6167f] 2026-11-05 21:43:55 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [e83298599] 2026-11-05 21:43:55 +0100
-->
     <para>
      修复 <varname>oauth_validator_libraries</varname> 被设置为仅包含空白的字符串时 postmaster 崩溃的问题（Grigorev Jurij，Zsolt Parragi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;99c3f5e20">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;459ef520d">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;af28fc13e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e83298599">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
Branch: master [d42c5457e] 2026-10-26 09:50:58 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [8d5e89328] 2026-10-26 09:50:58 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [e88259b67] 2026-10-26 09:50:58 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [eea2ff293] 2026-10-26 09:50:58 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [4bd8a9613] 2026-10-26 09:50:58 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [eed7bffad] 2026-10-26 09:50:58 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [3651d7c58] 2026-10-26 09:50:58 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复 B-树索引中多层页面删除的 WAL 记录（Peter Geoghegan）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e88259b67">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      WAL 日志可能包含待删除页面的过时兄弟链接值，在启用 <varname>wal_consistency_checking</varname> 时引发备库报错。只要没有崩溃，删除动作完成后很快就会修复损坏，因此此错误通常只影响报错信息。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [27caf4ca5] 2026-10-29 11:13:44 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [4232bf96e] 2026-10-29 11:13:59 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [7ac2f74d1] 2026-10-29 11:14:10 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [fd1f61e43] 2026-10-29 11:14:34 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免对仅被钉住而未锁定的缓冲区执行过强的 WAL 一致性检查（Greg Burd，Thomas Munro）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7ac2f74d1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      未锁定的缓冲区可能被其他进程并发修改，导致为一致性检查捕获的映像自身不一致，从而使备库报出<quote>incorrect resource manager data checksum in record</quote>错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [a5ccf2080] 2026-10-26 17:14:07 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2c4a3b3b2] 2026-10-26 17:14:20 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [606f3db55] 2026-10-26 17:14:26 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [15f57b683] 2026-10-26 17:14:35 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [11c87ab37] 2026-10-26 17:14:42 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [4b9009105] 2026-10-26 17:14:53 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [b15c55163] 2026-10-26 17:14:57 +0900
-->
     <para>
      确保检查点期间以原子方式写出待处理预备事务的状态文件（Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;606f3db55">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此前，崩溃可能留下无效的状态文件，导致后续数据库启动失败。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [cea96cdfe] 2026-11-02 15:17:57 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ee189838f] 2026-11-02 15:18:01 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [3a2fc7662] 2026-11-02 15:18:04 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [56e831ea2] 2026-11-02 15:18:09 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [bb4eabd6a] 2026-11-02 15:18:13 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [a39ec399e] 2026-11-02 15:18:17 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [ea1b698f2] 2026-11-02 15:18:21 +0900
-->
     <para>
      不在中止预备事务的中途启动检查点（Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3a2fc7662">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      崩溃可能使该事务随后被提交，导致状态不一致。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
Branch: master [4f3121202] 2026-11-03 01:39:20 +0200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [0035e91dd] 2026-11-03 01:41:34 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [31538e165] 2026-11-03 01:42:07 +0200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [4022edb93] 2026-11-03 01:43:09 +0200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [0d0bde0b0] 2026-11-03 01:43:25 +0200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [8681aef6f] 2026-11-03 01:43:41 +0200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [67fa8cb33] 2026-11-03 01:53:23 +0200
-->
     <para>
      不在创建多事务的中途启动检查点（Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;31538e165">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这可以避免随后发生崩溃时可能出现的数据丢失。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [e7f4463e8] 2026-10-26 09:54:08 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [928c2eeed] 2026-10-26 09:54:17 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5df84b355] 2026-10-26 09:54:30 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [08f0cec8f] 2026-10-26 09:54:44 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [07d1b4418] 2026-10-26 09:54:50 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [0b5656749] 2026-10-26 09:54:56 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [278d2a672] 2026-10-26 09:55:01 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复被随后中止的子事务更新过的元组可能丢失的问题（Shihao Zhong，Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5df84b355">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      表重写（例如 <command>CLUSTER</command> 或 <command>VACUUM FULL</command>）可能将此类元组当作无效元组丢弃。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [8a8ee213d] 2026-11-02 10:13:52 -0600
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ea11f9464] 2026-11-02 10:13:52 -0600
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [badcb62d6] 2026-11-02 10:13:52 -0600
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [7e594c30f] 2026-11-02 10:13:52 -0600
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [c5c36ae6f] 2026-11-02 10:13:52 -0600
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [a3d1ac495] 2026-11-02 10:13:52 -0600
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [4e9a5dc1f] 2026-11-02 10:13:52 -0600
-->
     <para>
      将元组存入元组表槽时不丢失其 <type>tid</type>（Virender Singla，Greg Burd）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;badcb62d6">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      某些代码路径忽略了复制 <type>tid</type> 字段，在特殊情况下可能导致数据损坏或查询结果错误。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
Branch: master [2ebd68497] 2026-10-25 10:23:46 +0100
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [57a2e2cf5] 2026-10-25 10:23:46 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [1735ad557] 2026-10-25 10:23:46 +0100
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [bd8070126] 2026-10-25 10:23:46 +0100
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [3bd5a4755] 2026-10-25 10:23:46 +0100
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [9ab37b6e7] 2026-10-25 10:23:46 +0100
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [31fa77982] 2026-10-25 10:23:46 +0100
-->
     <para>
      避免将分区索引标记为有效时的竞态条件（Andrey Borodin，Kirill Reshke）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1735ad557">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      例如，这可能使并行 <application>pg_restore</application> 因过早尝试重建外键约束而失败。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
Branch: master [068c9aaec] 2026-10-15 11:23:06 +0300
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ad56a7f09] 2026-10-15 11:23:09 +0300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [94d53e9ec] 2026-10-15 11:23:12 +0300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [ff9eacc56] 2026-10-15 11:23:13 +0300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [7cafc4abb] 2026-10-15 11:23:15 +0300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [f51a03db3] 2026-10-15 11:23:17 +0300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [623cdfa64] 2026-10-15 11:23:19 +0300
-->
     <para>
      修复多事务 ID 中对已中止的更新事务的检查（Chee Wooson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;94d53e9ec">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一编码错误的已知后果包括意外的<quote>new multixact has more than one updating member</quote>错误，以及错误地无法更新行。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
Branch: master [173cf85a0] 2026-10-10 10:26:18 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [c4117066b] 2026-10-10 10:26:18 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [a85b5523e] 2026-10-10 10:26:18 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [ab2233743] 2026-10-10 10:26:18 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [99ae176e4] 2026-10-10 10:26:18 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [1495e2cba] 2026-10-10 10:26:18 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [22be34ac1] 2026-10-10 10:26:18 -0400
-->
     <para>
      在桶分裂期间开始的哈希索引扫描可能漏掉某些索引项（Peter Geoghegan，Amit Kapila）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a85b5523e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [374522aa6] 2026-09-24 01:18:37 +1200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ad230d588] 2026-09-24 01:19:38 +1200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [39a0db101] 2026-09-24 01:20:02 +1200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [25ebf0097] 2026-09-24 01:20:27 +1200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [6ceac2e12] 2026-09-24 01:20:53 +1200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [cd7d3e129] 2026-09-24 01:21:15 +1200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [c84dd31bd] 2026-09-24 01:21:45 +1200
-->
     <para>
      修复 TID 范围扫描中不正确的位置跟踪（Ewan Young，David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;39a0db101">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      先向后提取再向前提取的操作序列，可能无法一直扫描到范围末尾。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
