     <para>
      恢复过程重放仅冻结和仅更新 VM 的 WAL 记录时，避免不必要的缓冲区锁定（Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9733eb9e8">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这可以避免不必要的重放延迟和备库查询取消。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [4a92c8c29] 2026-10-28 08:42:35 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [e2c633b43] 2026-10-28 08:42:41 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [8cddd5fc8] 2026-10-28 08:42:52 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [4aeefb26d] 2026-10-28 08:42:57 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [5dc3cfbb9] 2026-10-28 08:43:00 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [316a87065] 2026-10-28 08:43:04 +0900
Branch: master [c97931c16] 2026-10-29 09:43:12 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [9c299e292] 2026-10-29 09:43:28 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [4f857f399] 2026-10-29 09:43:44 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [59bc83d41] 2026-10-29 09:44:07 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [38ecdfdc1] 2026-10-29 09:44:16 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [4b87b605b] 2026-10-29 09:44:23 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [0cfd56254] 2026-10-28 07:54:31 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [d2c1e18de] 2026-10-28 08:00:23 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免在基础备份中读取 <literal>pg_control</literal> 文件可能发生撕裂的副本（David Steele）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8cddd5fc8">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4f857f399">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      对该文件的并发写入可能导致备份包含不一致的数据。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [51d7bf5ed] 2026-10-27 13:53:26 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2bfed4d18] 2026-10-27 13:53:42 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [b09b26ac8] 2026-10-27 13:53:46 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [1fbe31b9d] 2026-10-27 13:53:52 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [61aec3f3b] 2026-10-27 13:53:59 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [1fff28b14] 2026-10-27 13:54:02 +0900
-->
     <para>
      防止在基础备份中错误地复制非关系文件（David Steele）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b09b26ac8">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      <filename>postgresql.auto.conf</filename> 等经常通过原子重命名替换的文件，在备份与这种替换并发进行时，可能在备份中被截断或填充零。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [340f2ac62] 2026-08-19 09:51:49 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [db0f6dd80] 2026-08-19 09:51:52 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [39faf4de2] 2026-08-19 09:51:54 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [7f92983dc] 2026-08-19 09:51:56 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [45c88d621] 2026-08-19 09:51:58 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [f555ada9e] 2026-08-19 09:51:59 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [19d900358] 2026-08-19 09:52:01 +0900
-->
     <para>
      确保基础备份报告仅影响单个页面的校验和失败（Zsolt Parragi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;39faf4de2">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      由于逻辑错误，只有同一文件中不止一个页面损坏时，<structname>pg_stat_database</structname> 才会累计校验和失败。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [b5545d3f5] 2026-11-05 18:06:25 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [dde54ecde] 2026-11-05 18:07:05 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [41b4b8e8b] 2026-11-05 18:07:17 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [0733c7219] 2026-11-05 18:07:48 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复堆截断后增量备份中的过时可见性映射（Ke，Fujii Masao，Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;41b4b8e8b">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      当数据校验和与 wal_log_hints 均被禁用时，在 <command>VACUUM</command> 截断表之后取得的增量备份，可能恢复过时的可见性映射位，导致数据损坏。
     </para>

     <para>
      此修复不会更正已有的 WAL 汇总，因此更新后取得的增量备份仍可能受到影响。建议使用增量备份的用户在更新后重新进行一次完整备份，并以此作为后续增量备份的基础。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [316861101] 2026-11-03 13:03:38 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [04ea11d0e] 2026-11-03 13:04:50 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [2afbad0ce] 2026-11-03 13:04:57 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [ecb43083f] 2026-11-03 13:05:04 +0900
-->
     <para>
      拒绝以历史已发生分叉的备份为基础的增量备份（Sai Pranav，Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2afbad0ce">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      故障切换后，增量备份可能接受一个 WAL 范围超过新主库离开旧时间线时切换点的先前备份。合并这些备份可能保留已废弃历史中的页面，产生损坏的备份。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [d903620ac] 2026-11-02 00:22:09 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2bae29d7e] 2026-11-02 00:23:01 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [9e20db542] 2026-11-02 00:23:07 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [9580e29da] 2026-11-02 00:24:02 +0900
-->
     <para>
      确保增量备份按 LSN 顺序合并 WAL 汇总（Ke，Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9e20db542">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此错误可能使合并后的备份包含过时数据。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [f549ecd26] 2026-11-02 00:17:17 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [ed89d84ed] 2026-11-02 00:18:13 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5787f8785] 2026-11-02 00:18:40 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [ec756e591] 2026-11-02 00:19:44 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复在边界情况下错误判断何时应将 WAL 汇总纳入增量备份的问题（Ayush Tiwari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5787f8785">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此错误可能使合并后的备份包含过时数据。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [cedd2cec7] 2026-10-14 19:55:24 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [97fa9bdc5] 2026-10-14 19:56:13 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [f47c63d7a] 2026-10-14 19:56:40 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [4c674b952] 2026-10-14 19:56:45 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复增量备份大小估算不正确的问题（Daria Lepikhova）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f47c63d7a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此问题影响 <application>pg_basebackup</application> 及其他位置的进度报告。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [fc1900915] 2026-11-05 09:49:17 +0530
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [1e1a4821a] 2026-11-05 09:42:16 +0530
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [fbaebf450] 2026-11-05 09:38:18 +0530
-->
     <para>
      复制订阅的 <literal>two_phase</literal> 状态已启用时，不再将其重置为待启用（Zhijie Hou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fbaebf450">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      执行两次 <literal>ALTER SUBSCRIPTION ... SET (two_phase = true)</literal> 会造成状态混乱，可能导致订阅者上的数据损坏。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [161d5ffcc] 2026-11-05 16:52:56 -0800
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [aad726131] 2026-11-05 16:53:34 -0800
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [e2b3549a4] 2026-11-05 16:53:48 -0800
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [7c78c8cff] 2026-11-05 16:54:21 -0800
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [079638030] 2026-11-05 16:54:37 -0800
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [d0571ca16] 2026-11-05 16:54:46 -0800
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [0c8611c6e] 2026-11-05 16:54:52 -0800
-->
     <para>
      在为 <varname>output_plugin_libraries</varname> 参数赋值时验证其语法（Jacob Champion，Hayato Kuroda）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e2b3549a4">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此前，语法错误的值可以写入 <filename>postgresql.conf</filename>，导致逻辑复制失败。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
Branch: master [bdaad789c] 2026-08-12 19:15:48 +0200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [82c86ac68] 2026-08-12 19:15:48 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [864ef0fb1] 2026-08-12 19:15:48 +0200
-->
     <para>
      如果键列有未经验证的 <literal>NOT NULL</literal> 约束，则拒绝 <literal>REPLICA IDENTITY USING INDEX</literal>（Ante Kresic）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;864ef0fb1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      复制标识键必须非空，但此代码路径此前会接受尚未确认满足这一条件的情况。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [3cde90ecc] 2026-10-21 08:50:02 +0530
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [48b43081e] 2026-10-21 08:42:06 +0530
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [23fffd382] 2026-10-21 08:34:27 +0530
-->
     <para>
      修复使用有损标识索引时的逻辑复制（Paul A. Jungwirth，Zhijie Hou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;23fffd382">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      标识索引通常是 B-树，能够提供精确结果。但多范围上的 GiST 索引也可用作标识索引，而其结果需要重新检查。逻辑复制此前未执行此检查，导致更新和删除可能作用于订阅者上的错误行。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [9510a826e] 2026-09-30 14:35:14 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [453ebae70] 2026-09-30 14:37:14 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [c5666f7e1] 2026-09-30 14:37:17 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [295f75b4b] 2026-09-30 14:37:19 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [02c32116d] 2026-09-30 14:37:21 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [3d15afe7d] 2026-09-30 14:37:23 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [56b306f8b] 2026-09-30 14:37:24 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免复制槽失效期间错误更新后端状态标志（Vlad Lesin）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c5666f7e1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      检查点进程等辅助进程执行失效操作时，可能破坏一个无关后端进程的状态字段。后果难以预测，但一种可能性是热备反馈实际上被禁用。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
Branch: master [beff3cd00] 2026-10-14 19:42:04 +0200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [963ff022f] 2026-10-14 19:42:04 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5eae2800a] 2026-10-14 19:42:04 +0200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [624bd2b1f] 2026-10-14 19:42:04 +0200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [ff5ba5f19] 2026-10-14 19:42:04 +0200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [0a6dc4fe1] 2026-10-14 19:42:04 +0200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [83be64488] 2026-10-14 19:42:04 +0200
-->
     <para>
      在逻辑复制中更好地处理子事务中止（Bingshuai Li，Hayato Kuroda，Zhijie Hou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5eae2800a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      如果一个更新了系统目录的子事务中止，逻辑解码仍错误地认为该更新有效，可能产生不正确的解码输出。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
Branch: master [46024c573] 2026-09-24 11:52:47 +0200
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [4a4bf490d] 2026-09-24 12:24:56 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6210f00ca] 2026-09-24 11:52:47 +0200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [b93df6eac] 2026-09-24 11:52:47 +0200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [a33ffaf7b] 2026-09-24 11:52:47 +0200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [5ff6a3d3f] 2026-09-24 11:52:47 +0200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [070e21268] 2026-09-24 11:52:47 +0200
-->
     <para>
      避免构建初始解码快照时的竞态条件（Antonin Houska，Rui Zhao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6210f00ca">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      使用包含已提交但尚未设置 CLOG 状态的事务的快照，存在较小的数据损坏风险。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [aa4c52b80] 2026-08-18 11:56:49 -0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [e4f16fda6] 2026-08-18 11:56:52 -0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [caa463e3f] 2026-08-18 11:56:55 -0700
-->
     <para>
      在逻辑解码中，避免为从未实际流式传输过的子事务处理流中止事件（Andrey Rachitskiy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;caa463e3f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此错误可能导致空指针解引用或其他异常行为。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [180f3dcd4] 2026-11-02 08:12:27 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [4fbae9145] 2026-11-02 08:12:34 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6437d9774] 2026-11-02 08:12:38 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [c3ef3f228] 2026-11-02 08:12:43 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [e8191e13f] 2026-11-02 08:12:47 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [c6cb792e8] 2026-11-02 08:12:50 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [35848657c] 2026-11-02 08:12:53 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免 <literal>pgoutput</literal> 逻辑复制发送器因复制选项缺少值而发生空指针崩溃（Zhijie Hou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6437d9774">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [bb1e3e475] 2026-09-18 10:18:52 -0700
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [e995b2cb4] 2026-09-18 10:18:55 -0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [a477847eb] 2026-09-18 10:18:58 -0700
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [3d6a4a582] 2026-09-18 10:19:01 -0700
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [feb975917] 2026-09-18 10:19:04 -0700
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [274da088e] 2026-09-18 10:19:07 -0700
-->
     <para>
      修复 <application>pgoutput</application> 处理流式传输的预备事务时的少量内存泄漏（Ayush Tiwari）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a477847eb">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [782d9cf8b] 2026-11-03 10:46:41 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [a9b32f4c8] 2026-11-03 10:47:27 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [1ff9f9380] 2026-11-03 10:47:34 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [6d34d5500] 2026-11-03 10:47:40 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [2ac618d71] 2026-11-03 10:48:12 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复物理 WAL 发送器丢失唤醒的问题（Alex Speller）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1ff9f9380">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      此修复更正了 WAL 发送进程在已有待发送数据时仍可能休眠的某些情况。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [58ff54aee] 2026-08-28 01:15:23 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [764d31b8a] 2026-08-28 01:15:59 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [2bf6144b4] 2026-08-28 01:16:04 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [4c8fa02c5] 2026-08-28 01:16:08 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [58fb12f4a] 2026-08-28 01:16:45 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [874c22c94] 2026-08-28 01:17:02 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [aec25d610] 2026-08-28 01:17:19 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 WAL 接收器跟随时间线切换时重复创建临时复制槽的问题（ChangAo Chen）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2bf6144b4">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一错误会先引发<quote>could not create replication slot</quote>错误，随后 WAL 接收器重启并恢复，因此不会造成永久损害。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [ad36e3608] 2026-09-28 07:17:39 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2f7bf51b7] 2026-09-28 07:11:29 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [af48a6702] 2026-09-28 06:57:50 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [0405dcf7c] 2026-09-28 06:44:47 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [2389f898e] 2026-09-28 06:52:24 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复逻辑复制订阅者与并发索引 DDL 之间的竞态条件（Mikhail Nikalayeu，Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;af48a6702">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      更改复制目标关系的主键索引或复制标识索引的状态，可能使复制应用逻辑漏掉匹配行（但每次此类事件最多漏掉一次）。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [01b3d24c4] 2026-11-03 10:49:40 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [472da35ac] 2026-11-03 10:50:33 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [092da6511] 2026-11-03 10:51:05 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [5f472ab56] 2026-11-03 10:51:47 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [bcb9d9051] 2026-11-03 10:51:55 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [3ec983535] 2026-11-03 10:52:01 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 WAL 解码错误消息中不正确的 LSN（Rahul Yadav）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;092da6511">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这些错误消息所报告的 LSN，对应的并不是实际引发报错的那条 WAL 记录。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
