     <para>
      修复 <literal>XMLSERIALIZE(... INDENT)</literal> 输出超过 1GB 时的重复释放（Jim Jones）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f10500777">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

