     <para>
      避免逻辑订阅刷新过程中相关关系被并发删除时发生空指针崩溃（Satyanarayana Narlapuram，Bharath Rupireddy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ec074c41e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [4f89416c9] 2026-10-30 17:29:32 +0900
