     <para>
      修复 <structname>pg_locks</structname>.<structfield>waitstart</structfield> 的值可能过时的问题（Shihao Zhong）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ccffd3439">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
