Branch: REL_14_STABLE [205f40f5b] 2026-10-14 10:16:26 +0900
-->
     <para>
      避免跨许多列计算 <literal>ndistinct</literal> 扩展统计信息时的内存膨胀（Ilia Evdokimov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;942266c7f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
Branch: master [49103c3cd] 2026-10-14 14:26:04 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [e61e120c1] 2026-10-14 14:26:04 -0400
