Branch: REL_15_STABLE [c949e6524] 2026-08-27 02:43:34 +1200
-->
     <para>
      确保为 <literal>AFTER</literal> 触发器打开的所有关系都被重新关闭（Hayato Kuroda，David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;715d83971">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      这一遗漏会触发<quote>resource was not closed</quote>警告，但不会造成更严重的后果。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [953c6dabd] 2026-11-05 18:02:22 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [62f868e77] 2026-11-05 18:03:16 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [5bfe88cf6] 2026-11-05 18:03:44 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复崩溃重启之间的 <literal>io_uring</literal> 资源泄漏（Lucas Draescher）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5bfe88cf6">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      最终，重启会因<quote>too many open files</quote>或类似错误而失败，此时 postmaster 才会退出并释放资源。这只影响使用非默认设置 <literal>io_method=io_uring</literal> 的情况。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [663c34c1e] 2026-10-26 14:03:23 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [791446a14] 2026-10-26 14:03:23 -0400
