     <para>
      增强 PL/Perl 和相关 contrib 模块对<quote>绑定</quote>的 Perl 哈希与数组的防护（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;af659efcb">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b6193ff03">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      依靠 <function>av_count()</function> 判断 Perl 数组长度，而不是查找空指针；另一方面，更谨慎地处理从数组和哈希提取值时意外出现的空值指针。目前只知道这些情况会在<quote>绑定</quote>对象中发生。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [1c9efb57e] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [5aed88ff9] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [94d625f5d] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [df9e6d7c7] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [72216a245] 2026-10-30 13:56:10 -0400
-->
     <para>
      避免 <application>libpq</application> 重复建立 GSS 连接时的内存泄漏（Matt Carter，Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;94d625f5d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [237176b79] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [a16088305] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [d33449024] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [a11bce64a] 2026-09-11 15:18:40 -0500
-->
     <para>
      避免 <function>getopt_long()</function> 重新排列程序命令行参数时出现不正确的行为（Sehrope Sarkuni）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d33449024">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      例如，<literal>vacuumdb postgres --jobs</literal> 会将 <literal>postgres</literal> 当作作业数量，而不是报告 <literal>--jobs</literal> 缺少参数。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [4fb6e9eb7] 2026-08-17 09:20:52 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [67342a148] 2026-08-17 09:21:06 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [baa7b142a] 2026-08-17 09:21:08 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <application>psql</application> 对表属性 <literal>REPLICA IDENTITY NOTHING</literal> 的显示（Shinya Kato）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;baa7b142a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [0d7baa209] 2026-08-14 12:14:23 -0400
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [7f8de6d87] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [bcb776671] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
