Branch: REL_16_STABLE [52f1eaae6] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [ed0a2b707] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [f1204c1a7] 2026-08-14 12:14:24 -0400
-->
     <para>
      确保 <application>psql</application> 统计多查询命令字符串中出现的所有 <command>COPY FROM STDIN</command> 命令（Zsolt Parragi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bcb776671">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      修复 CVE-2026-6464 后，<application>psql</application> 会拒绝同一字符串中出现的多个 <command>COPY FROM STDIN</command> 命令，因为它没有预期会发生多次 <command>COPY</command> 操作。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [d2ba58047] 2026-08-21 12:36:01 +0900
Branch: REL_19_STABLE [2b0d50e39] 2026-08-21 12:37:14 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [fd9bb365d] 2026-08-21 12:37:20 +0900
-->
     <para>
      防止 <command>\getresults</command> 的参数无效时 <application>psql</application> 状态混乱（Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fd9bb365d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
