Branch: REL_16_STABLE [6c760f6b6] 2026-07-28 10:39:50 -0700
-->

     <para>
      修复 <function>pg_get_publication_tables()</function> 在可发布表被并发删除时失败的问题（Bharath Rupireddy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;73d63d1c1">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>


    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
