Branch: REL_14_STABLE [e520ad34b] 2026-06-24 09:17:36 +0900
-->

     <para>
      在 <application>PL/Perl</application> 中，避免处理无效的
      <type>PostgreSQL::InServer::ARRAY</type> 对象时因解引用 NULL 指针而崩溃（Xing Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e430ecc59">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>


    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
Branch: master Release: REL_19_BR [8612f0b7c] 2026-06-29 11:38:39 +0900
