Branch: REL_15_STABLE [bdccb6302] 2025-09-30 23:54:01 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [cb21e1f92] 2025-09-30 23:55:02 +0900
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [7d7e81d1e] 2025-09-30 23:55:33 +0900
-->
     <para>
      修复 <application>pgbench</application> 的多错误报告（Yugo Nagata）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;29aabbc43">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      在连续两次 <function>PQgetResult</function> 调用都失败的情况下，<application>pgbench</application> 可能报告错误的错误消息。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [8bb174295] 2025-09-26 21:23:43 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [c736808e0] 2025-09-26 21:24:59 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [f39d9164b] 2025-09-26 21:25:05 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [8b2e290bd] 2025-09-26 21:25:11 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [704f51771] 2025-09-26 21:25:17 +0900
-->
     <para>
      在 <application>pgbench</application> 中，修复流水线模式下关于错误的错误断言（Yugo Nagata）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c736808e0">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [9224c3025] 2025-10-22 13:38:40 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [e2072b47b] 2025-10-22 13:38:37 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [4eb6992af] 2025-10-22 13:38:37 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复 <application>pg_combinebackup</application> 中每个文件的内存泄漏（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e2072b47b">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [8ae0f6a0c] 2025-11-04 15:47:25 -0800
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [71aa2e114] 2025-11-04 15:47:22 -0800
Branch: master [eab9e4e27] 2025-08-19 12:11:42 -0700
Branch: REL_18_STABLE Release: REL_18_0 [0beb7e933] 2025-08-19 12:11:39 -0700
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [b6090ed96] 2025-08-19 12:11:37 -0700
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [815fcfb20] 2025-08-19 12:11:34 -0700
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [eb9ee4d18] 2025-08-19 12:11:32 -0700
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [79643105a] 2025-08-19 12:11:29 -0700
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [7d8d36289] 2025-08-19 12:11:25 -0700
-->
     <para>
      确保 <filename>contrib/pg_buffercache</filename> 函数可以被取消（Satyanarayana Narlapuram，Yuhang Qiu）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;71aa2e114">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0beb7e933">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      某些代码路径能够长时间运行而不检查中断。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [208927e65] 2025-10-17 11:36:50 -0500
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [3ccf8e9ac] 2025-10-17 11:36:50 -0500
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [a0551bc57] 2025-10-17 11:36:50 -0500
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [fae0ce5e3] 2025-10-17 11:36:50 -0500
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [6c03ae8d6] 2025-10-17 11:36:50 -0500
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [f146eb45c] 2025-10-17 11:36:50 -0500
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [19a64f567] 2025-10-17 11:36:50 -0500
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
Branch: master [da44d71e7] 2025-10-18 18:36:21 -0400
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [c29d32d27] 2025-10-18 18:36:21 -0400
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [d4e8c37cc] 2025-10-18 18:36:21 -0400
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [c26a8eaf6] 2025-10-18 18:36:21 -0400
-->
     <para>
      修复 <filename>contrib/pg_prewarm</filename> 对索引的权限检查（Ayush Vatsa，Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3ccf8e9ac">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c29d32d27">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      <function>pg_prewarm()</function> 要求对要预热的关系具有 <literal>SELECT</literal>
      权限。但由于索引没有自己的 SQL 权限，这导致非超级用户无法预热索引。改为检查索引所属表的 <literal>SELECT</literal> 权限。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
Branch: master [16edc1b94] 2025-10-29 12:35:02 +0100
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [b1635c166] 2025-10-29 12:35:02 +0100
-->
     <para>
      在 <filename>contrib/pg_stat_statements</filename> 中，避免当 SQL 语句文本中的两个或多个常量被标记为同一位置时发生崩溃（Sami Imseih、Dmitry Dolgov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b1635c166">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master [684a745f5] 2025-10-02 11:07:30 +0900
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [fc295beb7] 2025-10-02 11:09:10 +0900
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [036decbba] 2025-10-02 11:09:12 +0900
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [c0f9fe877] 2025-10-02 11:09:13 +0900
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [49b5f0b53] 2025-10-02 11:09:15 +0900
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [ee2dbcad0] 2025-10-02 11:09:17 +0900
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [c207bf473] 2025-10-02 11:09:19 +0900
-->
     <para>
      使 <filename>contrib/pgstattuple</filename> 更健壮地处理空页面或无效索引页面（Nitin Motiani）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fc295beb7">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      将全零页面计为空闲空间，并忽略根据页面特殊空间大小检查判定为无效的页面。B-树索引的代码已经将全零页面计为空闲空间，但 hash 和 gist 的代码会报告错误并退出，这被发现对用户不太友好。同样，使这三种情况在忽略损坏页面而非抛出错误方面保持一致。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
Branch: master [c5d34f4a5] 2025-11-08 12:26:43 +1300
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [f8ccab0e9] 2025-11-08 12:28:15 +1300
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [03d9140cb] 2025-11-08 12:28:52 +1300
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [2f76ffe5e] 2025-11-08 12:29:15 +1300
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [1c7cba4c5] 2025-11-08 12:30:08 +1300
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [d8ba910b0] 2025-11-08 12:32:42 +1300
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [77b5b2c6f] 2025-11-08 12:33:01 +1300
-->
     <para>
      加固我们的读写屏障宏以满足 Clang 的要求（Thomas Munro）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f8ccab0e9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
      我们假设 <function>__atomic_thread_fence()</function> 是防止 C 编译器在其周围重排内存访问的充分屏障，但似乎对于 Clang 来说并非如此，导致它至少为 RISC-V、MIPS 和 LoongArch 机器生成不正确的代码。添加显式编译器屏障来修复此问题。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
Branch: master [6ad9378c9] 2025-10-16 20:21:05 +0200
Branch: REL_18_STABLE [6aa04a60c] 2025-10-16 20:21:05 +0200
Branch: REL_17_STABLE [a8933194e] 2025-10-16 20:21:05 +0200
Branch: REL_16_STABLE [a506b0c0a] 2025-10-16 20:21:05 +0200
Branch: REL_15_STABLE [33202cba8] 2025-10-16 20:21:05 +0200
Branch: REL_14_STABLE [56cd332f8] 2025-10-16 20:21:05 +0200
Branch: REL_13_STABLE [f768f5a7d] 2025-10-16 20:21:05 +0200
-->
     <para>
      修复 PGXS 构建基础设施以支持为扩展构建
      NLS <filename>po</filename> 文件（Ryo Matsumura）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6aa04a60c">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
    </listitem>

   </itemizedlist>

  </sect2>
 </sect1>

 <sect1 id="release-18">
  <title>发布版本 18</title>

  <formalpara>
   <title>发布日期：</title>
   <para>
   2025-09-25
  </para>
  </formalpara>

  <sect2 id="release-18-highlights">
   <title>概述</title>

   <para>
    <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 18 包含许多新特性和增强功能，包括：
   </para>

   <itemizedlist>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      异步 I/O（AIO）子系统，可以提高顺序扫描、位图堆扫描、清理和其他操作的性能。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
     <para>
      <link linkend="pgupgrade"><application>pg_upgrade</application></link> 现在保留优化器统计信息。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
    <para>
      支持“跳过扫描”，允许在更多情况下使用<link linkend="indexes-multicolumn">多列 B-树索引</link>。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
    <para>
      用于生成按时间戳排序的 <link linkend="datatype-uuid">UUID</link> 的 <link linkend="func_uuid_gen_table"><function>uuidv7()</function></link> 函数。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
    <para>
      虚拟<link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-generated-stored">生成列</link>，它们在读取期间计算其值。这现在是生成列的默认设置。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
    <para>
      支持 <link linkend="auth-oauth">OAuth 认证</link>。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
    <para>
      在<xref linkend="sql-insert"/>、<xref linkend="sql-update"/>、<xref linkend="sql-delete"/>和<xref linkend="sql-merge"/>命令的 <link linkend="dml-returning"><literal>RETURNING</literal></link> 子句中支持 <literal>OLD</literal> 和 <literal>NEW</literal>。
     </para>
    </listitem>

    <listitem>
    <para>
      为 <link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-primary-key">PRIMARY KEY</link>、<link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-unique">UNIQUE</link> 和 <link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-references">FOREIGN KEY</link> 约束提供时间约束或范围约束。
     </para>
    </listitem>
   </itemizedlist>

   <para>
    下面几节将更详细地解释上述项目以及 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 18 的其他新特性。
   </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2  id="release-18-migration">

   <title>迁移到版本 18</title>

   <para>
    对于希望从任何以前的版本迁移数据的人来说，需要使用<xref linkend="app-pg-dumpall"/>进行转储/恢复，或者使用<xref linkend="pgupgrade"/>或逻辑复制。有关迁移到新主要版本的通用信息，请参阅<xref
    linkend="upgrading"/>。
   </para>

   <para>
    版本 18 包含许多可能影响与以前版本兼容性的更改。请注意以下不兼容项：
   </para>

   <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-10-16 [04bec894a04] initdb: Change default to using data checksums.
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    将<xref linkend="app-initdb"/>默认更改为启用数据校验和（Greg Sabino Mullane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;04bec894a04">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    可以使用新的 <application>initdb</application> 选项 <option>--no-data-checksums</option> 禁用校验和。<xref linkend="pgupgrade"/>要求匹配集簇校验和设置，因此这个新选项对于升级不带校验和的旧集簇很有用。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-01-16 [d7674c9fa] Seek zone abbreviations in the IANA data before timezone
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    更改时区缩写处理（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d7674c9fa">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    系统现在将优先考虑当前会话的时区缩写，然后检查服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-timezone-abbreviations"/>。以前是先检查 <varname>timezone_abbreviations</varname>。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-12-02 [db6a4a985] Deprecate MD5 passwords.
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    弃用 <link linkend="auth-password">MD5 密码</link>认证（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;db6a4a985">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    对 MD5 密码的支持将在未来的主要版本中移除。<xref linkend="sql-createrole"/>和<xref
    linkend="sql-alterrole"/>现在在设置 MD5 密码时会发出弃用警告。可以通过将<xref linkend="guc-md5-password-warnings"/>参数设置为 <literal>off</literal> 来禁用这些警告。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-09-24 [62ddf7ee9] Add ONLY support for VACUUM and ANALYZE
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    更改<xref linkend="sql-vacuum"/>和<xref linkend="sql-analyze"/>以处理父表的继承子表（Michael Harris）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;62ddf7ee9">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    可以使用新的 <literal>ONLY</literal> 选项执行以前的行为。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-09-30 [770233748] Do not treat \. as an EOF marker in CSV mode for COPY IN
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-10-01 [da8a4c166] Reject a copy EOF marker that has data ahead of it on th
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    防止 <link linkend="sql-copy"><command>COPY FROM</command></link> 在读取 <acronym>CSV</acronym> 文件时将 <literal>\.</literal> 视为文件结束标记（Daniel Vérité, Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;770233748">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;da8a4c166">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    <xref linkend="app-psql"/>在从 <literal>STDIN</literal> 读取 <acronym>CSV</acronym> 文件时仍会将 <literal>\.</literal> 视为文件结束标记。较旧的 <application>psql</application> 客户端连接到 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 18 服务器时，可能会在 <link
    linkend="app-psql-meta-commands-copy"><literal>\copy</literal></link> 上遇到问题。此版本还强制要求 <literal>\.</literal> 必须单独出现在一行中。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-10-03 [e2bab2d79] Remove support for unlogged on partitioned tables
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    禁止不记录 WAL 的分区表（Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e2bab2d79">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    以前 <link linkend="sql-altertable"><command>ALTER TABLE SET
    [UN]LOGGED</command></link> 不执行任何操作，并且创建不记录 WAL 的分区表也不会导致其子表不记录 WAL。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-01-23 [01463e1cc] Ensure that AFTER triggers run as the instigating user.
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    让 <literal>AFTER</literal> <link
    linkend="triggers">触发器</link>以触发器事件排队时处于活动状态的角色身份执行（Laurenz Albe）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;01463e1cc">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    以前，此类触发器以执行时（例如，在<xref linkend="sql-commit"/>时）处于活动状态的角色身份运行。这对于在排队时间和事务提交之间角色发生变化的情况很重要。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<listitem>
      <para>
      对 <literal>RESTRICT</literal> <link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-references">外键</link>违规使用 <link linkend="errcodes-appendix"><literal>SQLSTATE</literal></link> <literal>23001</literal>（<literal>restrict_violation</literal>）报告，而不是 <literal>23503</literal>（<literal>foreign_key_violation</literal>）（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;086c84b23">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-09-12 [fefa76f70] Remove old RULE privilege completely.
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    移除<xref
    linkend="sql-grant"/>/<xref linkend="sql-revoke"/>中不起作用的规则权限支持（Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fefa76f70">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    这些权限自 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 8.2 起就已不起作用。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-08-12 [f0d112759] Remove "parent" column from pg_backend_memory_contexts
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    移除列 <link
    linkend="view-pg-backend-memory-contexts"><structname>pg_backend_memory_contexts</structname></link>.<structfield>parent</structfield>（Melih Mutlu）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f0d112759">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    由于添加了 <structname>pg_backend_memory_contexts</structname>.<structfield>path</structfield>，不再需要此列。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-07-25 [32d3ed816] Add path column to pg_backend_memory_contexts view
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2025-04-18 [d9e03864b] Make levels 1-based in
    pg_log_backend_memory_contexts()
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-04-21 [706cbed35] doc: Fix memory context level in pg_log_backend_memory_c
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    将 <structname>pg_backend_memory_contexts</structname>.<structfield>level</structfield> 和 <link
    linkend="functions-admin-signal-table"><function>pg_log_backend_memory_contexts()</function></link> 更改为从1开始（Melih Mutlu, Atsushi Torikoshi, David Rowley, Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;32d3ed816">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d9e03864b">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;706cbed35">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    这些以前是从零开始的。
    </para>
    </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-12-17 [fb1a18810f0] Remove ts_locale.c's lowerstr()
-->

    <listitem>
    <para>
    更改<link linkend="textsearch">全文检索</link>，使其使用数据库集簇默认排序规则提供程序来读取配置文件和词典，而不再始终使用 libc（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fb1a18810f0">&sect;</ulink>
    </para>

    <para>
    如果数据库集簇默认使用的非 libc 排序规则提供程序（例如 ICU、builtin）对 LC_CTYPE 所处理字符的处理方式与 libc 不同，那么某些全文检索函数以及<xref linkend="pgtrgm"/>扩展的行为可能会发生变化。使用<xref linkend="pgupgrade"/>升级此类数据库集簇时，建议在升级后重新索引所有与全文检索和<application>pg_trgm</application>相关的索引。
    </para>
    </listitem>

   </itemizedlist>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 id="release-18-changes">
   <title>变更</title>

    <para>
     下面您将找到 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 18 与以前主要版本之间变化的详细说明。
    </para>

   <sect3 id="release-18-server">
    <title>服务器</title>

    <sect4 id="release-18-optimizer">
     <title>优化器</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2025-02-17 [fc069a3a6] Implement Self-Join Elimination
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      自动删除一些不必要的表自连接（Andrey Lepikhov, Alexander Kuzmenkov, Alexander Korotkov, Alena Rybakina）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fc069a3a6">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      可以使用服务器变量<xref
      linkend="guc-enable-self-join-elimination"/>禁用此优化。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2025-04-04 [c0962a113] Convert 'x IN (VALUES ...)' to 'x = ANY ...' then approp
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将一些 <link
      linkend="functions-comparisons-in-scalar"><literal>IN (VALUES
      ...)</literal></link> 转换为 <literal>x = ANY ...</literal> 以获得更好的优化器统计信息（Alena Rybakina, Andrei Lepikhov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c0962a113">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2024-11-24 [ae4569161] Teach bitmap path generation about transforming OR-claus
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许将 <link
      linkend="functions-logical"><literal>OR</literal></link> 子句转换为数组以加快索引处理（Alexander Korotkov, Andrey Lepikhov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ae4569161">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-09-10 [52c707483] Use a hash table to de-duplicate column names in ruleuti
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-12-19 [276279295] Convert SetOp to read its inputs as outerPlan and innerP
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-12-19 [8d96f57d5] Improve planner's handling of SetOp plans.
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-09-05 [908a96861] Optimize WindowAgg's use of tuplestores
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      加快 <link
      linkend="sql-intersect"><literal>INTERSECT</literal></link>、<link linkend="sql-except"><literal>EXCEPT</literal></link>、<link
      linkend="tutorial-window">窗口聚合</link>和<link
      linkend="sql-createview">视图列别名</link>的处理速度（Tom Lane, David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;52c707483">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;276279295">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8d96f57d5">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;908a96861">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-11-26 [a8ccf4e93] Reordering DISTINCT keys to match input path's pathkeys
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许 <link linkend="sql-distinct"><command>SELECT
      DISTINCT</command></link> 的键在内部重新排序以避免排序（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a8ccf4e93">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      可以使用<xref
      linkend="guc-enable-distinct-reordering"/>禁用此优化。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-12-12 [bd10ec529] Detect redundant GROUP BY columns using UNIQUE indexes
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      忽略功能上依赖于其他列的 <link linkend="sql-groupby"><literal>GROUP BY</literal></link> 列（Zhang Mingli, Jian He, David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bd10ec529">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      如果 <literal>GROUP BY</literal> 子句包含唯一索引的所有列以及同一表的其他列，则这些其他列是冗余的，可以从分组中删除。对于非延迟主键，这已经成立。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-10-09 [67a54b9e8] Allow pushdown of HAVING clauses with grouping sets
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-09-10 [247dea89f] Introduce an RTE for the grouping step
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-09-10 [f5050f795] Mark expressions nullable by grouping sets
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-03-13 [cc5d98525] Fix incorrect handling of subquery pullup
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许将作用于 <link linkend="queries-grouping-sets"><literal>GROUPING
      SETS</literal></link> 的某些 <link
      linkend="sql-having"><literal>HAVING</literal></link> 子句下推到 <link
      linkend="sql-where"><literal>WHERE</literal></link> 子句（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;67a54b9e8">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;247dea89f">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f5050f795">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cc5d98525">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这允许更早地进行行过滤。此版本还修复了一些以前返回不正确结果的 <literal>GROUPING SETS</literal> 查询。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-07-09 [036bdcec9] Teach planner how to estimate rows for timestamp generat
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2024-12-02 [97173536e] Add a planner support function for numeric generate_seri
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      改进 <link
      linkend="functions-srf-series"><function>generate_series()</function></link> 使用 <link linkend="datatype-numeric"><type>numeric</type></link> 和 <link linkend="datatype-datetime"><type>timestamp</type></link> 值时的行数估计（David Rowley, Song Jinzhou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;036bdcec9">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;97173536e">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-07-05 [aa86129e1] Support "Right Semi Join" plan shapes
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许优化器使用 <literal>Right Semi Join</literal> 计划（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;aa86129e1">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      半连接用于查找是否存在至少一个匹配项。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-10-09 [828e94c9d] Consider explicit incremental sort for mergejoins
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许合并连接使用<link
      linkend="guc-enable-incremental-sort">增量排序</link>（Richard Guo）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;828e94c9d">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Langote <amitlan@postgresql.org>
2025-04-04 [88f55bc97] Make derived clause lookup in EquivalenceClass more effi
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2025-04-08 [d69d45a5a] Speedup child EquivalenceMember lookup in planner
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      提高访问多个分区的查询规划效率（Ashutosh Bapat, Yuya Watari, David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;88f55bc97">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d69d45a5a">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-07-30 [9b282a935] Fix partitionwise join with partially-redundant join cla
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2024-07-29 [513f4472a] Reduce memory used by partitionwise joins
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      在更多情况下允许<link linkend="guc-enable-partitionwise-join">分区连接</link>，并减少其内存使用（Richard Guo, Tom Lane, Ashutosh Bapat）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9b282a935">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;513f4472a">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Alexander Korotkov <akorotkov@postgresql.org>
2025-03-10 [fae535da0] Teach Append to consider tuple_fraction when accumulatin
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      改进分区查询的代价估算（Nikita Malakhov, Andrei Lepikhov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fae535da0">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-04-02 [0dca5d68d] Change SQL-language functions to use the plan cache.
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-04-17 [09b07c295] Minor performance improvement for SQL-language functions
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      改进 <link linkend="xfunc-sql"><acronym>SQL</acronym> 语言函数</link>的计划缓存（Alexander Pyhalov, Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0dca5d68d">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;09b07c295">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2024-08-21 [e22253467] Treat number of disabled nodes in a path as a separate c
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      改进禁用优化器功能的处理（Robert Haas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e22253467">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-indexes">
     <title>索引</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
2025-04-04 [92fe23d93] Add nbtree skip scan optimization.
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
2025-04-04 [8a510275d] Further optimize nbtree search scan key comparisons.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许 <link linkend="xfunc-sql">B-树</link>索引的跳过扫描（Peter Geoghegan）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;92fe23d93">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8a510275d">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这允许在更多情况下使用多列 B-树索引，例如，当第一个或较早的索引列上没有限制（或只有非等值限制），而后续索引列上存在有效限制时。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-18 [f278e1fe3] Allow non-btree unique indexes for partition keys
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-18 [9d6db8bec] Allow non-btree unique indexes for matviews
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许非 B-树唯一索引用作分区键，并用于物化视图（Mark Dilger）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f278e1fe3">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9d6db8bec">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      索引类型仍必须支持相等性。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2025-03-03 [8492feb98] Allow parallel CREATE INDEX for GIN indexes
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许并行创建 <link linkend="gin"><literal>GIN</literal></link> 索引（Tomas Vondra, Matthias van de Meent）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8492feb98">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2025-04-02 [e9e7b6604] Add GiST and btree sortsupport routines for range types
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许对值进行排序以加快范围类型 <link
      linkend="gist">GiST</link> 和 <link linkend="btree">B-树</link>索引构建（Bernd Helmle）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e9e7b6604">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-performance">
     <title>一般性能</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-17 [02844012b] aio: Basic subsystem initialization
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-17 [da7226993] aio: Add core asynchronous I/O infrastructure
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-18 [55b454d0e] aio: Infrastructure for io_method=worker
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-18 [247ce06b8] aio: Add io_method=worker
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2025-03-19 [10f664684] Introduce io_max_combine_limit.
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2025-03-19 [06fb5612c] Increase io_combine_limit range to 1MB.
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-26 [c325a7633] aio: Add io_method=io_uring
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-29 [50cb7505b] aio: Implement support for reads in smgr/md/fd
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-30 [047cba7fa] bufmgr: Implement AIO read support
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-30 [12ce89fd0] bufmgr: Use AIO in StartReadBuffers()
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-30 [2a5e709e7] Enable IO concurrency on all systems
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加异步 I/O 子系统（Andres Freund, Thomas Munro, Nazir Bilal Yavuz, Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;02844012b">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;da7226993">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;55b454d0e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;247ce06b8">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;10f664684">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;06fb5612c">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c325a7633">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;50cb7505b">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;047cba7fa">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;12ce89fd0">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2a5e709e7">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      此功能允许后端排队多个读取请求，从而实现更高效的顺序扫描、位图堆扫描、清理等。这由服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-io-method"/>启用，并添加了服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-io-combine-limit"/>和<xref
      linkend="guc-io-max-combine-limit"/>来控制它。这还使得不支持 <function>fadvise()</function> 的系统也可以将<xref linkend="guc-effective-io-concurrency"/>和<xref linkend="guc-maintenance-io-concurrency"/>设为大于零的值。新的系统视图 <link
      linkend="view-pg-aios"><structname>pg_aios</structname></link> 显示用于异步 I/O 的文件句柄。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2024-09-21 [c4d5cb71d] Increase the number of fast-path lock slots
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      改进访问许多关系的查询的锁定性能（Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c4d5cb71d">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-08-20 [adf97c156] Speed up Hash Join by making ExprStates support hashing
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-12-11 [0f5738202] Use ExprStates for hashing in GROUP BY and SubPlans
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-03-24 [4d143509c] Create accessor functions for TupleHashEntry.
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-03-24 [a0942f441] Add ExecCopySlotMinimalTupleExtra().
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-03-24 [626df47ad] Remove 'additional' pointer from TupleHashEntryData.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      提高哈希连接和 <link linkend="sql-groupby"><literal>GROUP BY</literal></link> 的性能并减少内存使用（David Rowley, Jeff Davis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;adf97c156">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0f5738202">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4d143509c">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a0942f441">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;626df47ad">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这也改进了 <link
      linkend="sql-except"><literal>EXCEPT</literal></link> 使用的 hash 集操作和子计划值的 hash 查找。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2025-02-11 [052026c9b] Eagerly scan all-visible pages to amortize aggressive va
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2025-03-03 [06eae9e62] Trigger more frequent autovacuums with relallfrozen
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许普通清理冻结某些页面，即使它们都是可见的（Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;052026c9b">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;06eae9e62">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这减少了后期全关系冻结的开销。其激进性可以通过服务器变量和每表设置<xref
      linkend="guc-vacuum-max-eager-freeze-failure-rate"/>控制。以前，在需要冻结之前，清理从不处理所有可见页面。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-20 [0164a0f9e] Add vacuum_truncate configuration parameter.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-vacuum-truncate"/>以控制<xref linkend="sql-vacuum"/>期间的文件截断（Nathan Bossart, Gurjeet Singh）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0164a0f9e">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      已经存在一个具有相同名称和行为的存储级别参数。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2025-03-12 [ff79b5b2a] Increase default effective_io_concurrency to 16
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2025-03-18 [cc6be07eb] Increase default maintenance_io_concurrency to 16
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将服务器变量<xref
      linkend="guc-effective-io-concurrency"/>和<xref
      linkend="guc-maintenance-io-concurrency"/>的默认值增加到 16（Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ff79b5b2a">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cc6be07eb">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这更准确地反映了现代硬件。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-monitoring">
     <title>监控</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2025-03-12 [9219093ca] Modularize log_connections output
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      增加服务器变量<xref
      linkend="guc-log-connections"/>的日志记录粒度（Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9219093ca">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      此服务器变量以前仅接受布尔值；布尔值用法仍受支持。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2025-03-12 [18cd15e70] Add connection establishment duration logging
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <varname>log_connections</varname> 选项以报告连接阶段的持续时间（Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;18cd15e70">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-04-07 [3516ea768] Add local-address escape "%L" to log_line_prefix.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<xref linkend="guc-log-line-prefix"/>转义 <literal>%L</literal> 以输出客户端所连接服务器的本地<acronym>IP</acronym>地址（Greg Sabino Mullane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3516ea768">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-03-14 [6d376c3b0] Add GUC option to log lock acquisition failures.
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-06-03 [73bdcfab3] Rename log_lock_failure GUC to log_lock_failures for con
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-log-lock-failures"/>以记录锁获取失败（Yuki Seino, Fujii Masao）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6d376c3b0">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;73bdcfab3">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      具体来说，它报告 <link
      linkend="sql-for-update-share"><command>SELECT
      ... NOWAIT</command></link> 锁失败。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-01-28 [30a6ed0ce] Track per-relation cumulative time spent in [auto]vacuum
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      修改 <link
      linkend="monitoring-pg-stat-all-tables-view"><structname>pg_stat_all_tables</structname></link> 及其变体以报告在<xref
      linkend="sql-vacuum"/>、<xref linkend="sql-analyze"/>及其<link linkend="autovacuum">自动执行</link>的变体中花费的时间（Sami Imseih）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;30a6ed0ce">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      新列是 <structfield>total_vacuum_time</structfield>、<structfield>total_autovacuum_time</structfield>、<structfield>total_analyze_time</structfield> 和 <structfield>total_autoanalyze_time</structfield>。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-02-11 [bb8dff999] Add cost-based vacuum delay time to progress views.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-02-14 [7720082ae] Add delay time to VACUUM/ANALYZE (VERBOSE) and autovacuu
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      向<xref linkend="sql-vacuum"/>和<xref
      linkend="sql-analyze"/>添加延迟时间报告（Bertrand Drouvot, Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bb8dff999">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7720082ae">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      此信息出现在服务器日志、系统视图 <link
      linkend="vacuum-progress-reporting"><structname>pg_stat_progress_vacuum</structname></link> 和 <link
      linkend="pg-stat-progress-analyze-view"><structname>pg_stat_progress_analyze</structname></link> 以及<xref linkend="sql-vacuum"/>和<xref
      linkend="sql-analyze"/>在 <literal>VERBOSE</literal> 模式下的输出中；必须使用服务器变量<xref
      linkend="guc-track-cost-delay-timing"/>启用跟踪。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2024-08-13 [4c1b4cdb8] Add resource statistics reporting to ANALYZE VERBOSE.
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2024-09-09 [bb7775234] Add WAL usage reporting to ANALYZE VERBOSE output.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<acronym>WAL</acronym>、<acronym>CPU</acronym>以及平均读取统计信息输出到 <command>ANALYZE VERBOSE</command>（Anthonin Bonnefoy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4c1b4cdb8">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bb7775234">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-17 [6a8a7ce47] Add information about WAL buffers full to VACUUM/ANALYZE
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加完整<acronym>WAL</acronym>缓冲区计数到 <command>VACUUM</command>/<command>ANALYZE (VERBOSE)</command> 和 autovacuum 日志输出（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6a8a7ce47">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-12-19 [9aea73fc6] Add backend-level statistics to pgstats
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-03-03 [3f1db99bf] Handle auxiliary processes in SQL functions of backend s
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加每后端 I/O 统计信息报告（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9aea73fc6">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3f1db99bf">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      统计信息通过 <link
      linkend="pg-stat-get-backend-io"><function>pg_stat_get_backend_io()</function></link> 访问。每后端 I/O 统计信息可以通过 <link
      linkend="monitoring-stats-funcs-table"><function>pg_stat_reset_backend_stats()</function></link> 清除。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-01-14 [f92c854cf] Make pg_stat_io count IOs as bytes instead of blocks for
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <link
      linkend="monitoring-pg-stat-io-view"><structname>pg_stat_io</structname></link> 列以字节报告 I/O 活动（Nazir Bilal Yavuz）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f92c854cf">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      新列是 <structfield>read_bytes</structfield>、<structfield>write_bytes</structfield> 和 <structfield>extend_bytes</structfield>。<structfield>op_bytes</structfield> 列（始终等于 <link linkend="guc-block-size"><varname>BLCKSZ</varname></link>）已移除。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-04 [a051e71e2] Add data for WAL in pg_stat_io and backend statistics
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-20 [4538bd3f1] doc: Add details about object "wal" in pg_stat_io
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-03-06 [7f7f324eb] Add more monitoring data for WAL writes in the WAL recei
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      向<structname>pg_stat_io</structname>添加<acronym>WAL</acronym> I/O 活动行（Nazir Bilal Yavuz, Bertrand Drouvot, Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a051e71e2">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4538bd3f1">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7f7f324eb">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这包括<acronym>WAL</acronym>接收器活动以及此类写入的等待事件。
      </para>

      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-26 [6c349d83b] Re-add GUC track_wal_io_timing
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      更改服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-track-wal-io-timing"/>以控制在<structname>pg_stat_io</structname>而不是 <link
      linkend="pg-stat-wal-view"><structname>pg_stat_wal</structname></link>中跟踪<acronym>WAL</acronym>计时（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c349d83b">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-24 [2421e9a51] Remove read/sync fields from pg_stat_wal and GUC track_w
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-26 [6c349d83b] Re-add GUC track_wal_io_timing
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      从 <structname>pg_stat_wal</structname> 中移除读/同步列（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2421e9a51">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c349d83b">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这会移除列 <structfield>wal_write</structfield>、<structfield>wal_sync</structfield>、<structfield>wal_write_time</structfield> 和 <structfield>wal_sync_time</structfield>。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-03-11 [76def4cdd] Add WAL data to backend statistics
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加函数 <link
      linkend="pg-stat-get-backend-wal"><function>pg_stat_get_backend_wal()</function></link> 以返回每后端<acronym>WAL</acronym>统计信息（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;76def4cdd">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      每后端<acronym>WAL</acronym>统计信息可以通过 <link
      linkend="monitoring-stats-funcs-table"><function>pg_stat_reset_backend_stats()</function></link> 清除。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-10-11 [4e1fad378] Add pg_ls_summariesdir().
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加函数 <link
      linkend="functions-admin-genfile-table"><function>pg_ls_summariesdir()</function></link> 以专门列出 <link
      linkend="storage-file-layout"><envar>PGDATA</envar></link>/<link
      linkend="guc-wal-summary-keep-time"><filename>pg_wal/summaries</filename></link> 的内容（Yushi Ogiwara）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4e1fad378">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-09-30 [559efce1d] Add num_done counter to the pg_stat_checkpointer view.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加列 <link
      linkend="monitoring-pg-stat-checkpointer-view"><structname>pg_stat_checkpointer</structname></link>.<structfield>num_done</structfield> 以报告已完成的检查点数量（Anton A. Melnikov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;559efce1d">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      列 <structfield>num_timed</structfield> 和 <structfield>num_requested</structfield> 同时统计已完成和已跳过的检查点。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-10-02 [17cc5f666] Fix inconsistent reporting of checkpointer stats.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加列 <structname>pg_stat_checkpointer</structname>.<structfield>slru_written</structfield> 以报告<acronym>SLRU</acronym>写入的缓冲区（Nitin Jadhav）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;17cc5f666">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      此外，修改检查点服务器日志消息以报告单独的共享缓冲区和<acronym>SLRU</acronym>缓冲区值。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-11-11 [e7a9496de] Add two attributes to pg_stat_database for parallel work
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加列到 <link
      linkend="monitoring-pg-stat-database-view"><structname>pg_stat_database</structname></link> 以报告并行工作者活动（Benoit Lobréau）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e7a9496de">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      新列是 <structfield>parallel_workers_to_launch</structfield> 和 <structfield>parallel_workers_launched</structfield>。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-03-18 [62d712ecf] Introduce squashing of constant lists in query jumbling
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-03-27 [9fbd53dea] Remove the query_id_squash_values GUC
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@kurilemu.de>
Branch: master Release: REL_18_BR [c2da1a5d6] 2025-06-24 19:36:32 +0200
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      让常量列表的<link linkend="guc-compute-query-id">查询 ID</link> 计算只考虑第一个和最后一个常量（Dmitry Dolgov, Sami Imseih）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;62d712ecf">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9fbd53dea">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c2da1a5d6">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      查询规范化由<xref linkend="pgstatstatements"/>使用。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-03-26 [787514b30] Use relation name instead of OID in query jumbling for R
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      调整查询 ID 计算以将使用相同关系名称的查询组合在一起（Michael Paquier, Sami Imseih）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;787514b30">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      即使不同模式中的表具有不同的列名，这也是成立的。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-07-01 [12227a1d5] Add context type field to pg_backend_memory_contexts
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加列 <link
      linkend="view-pg-backend-memory-contexts"><structname>pg_backend_memory_contexts</structname></link>.<structfield>type</structfield> 以报告内存上下文的类型（David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;12227a1d5">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-07-25 [32d3ed816] Add path column to pg_backend_memory_contexts view
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加列 <structname>pg_backend_memory_contexts</structname>.<structfield>path</structfield> 以显示内存上下文父级（Melih Mutlu）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;32d3ed816">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-privileges">
     <title>权限</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-07-04 [4564f1ceb] Add pg_get_acl() to get the ACL for a database object
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-07-10 [d898665bf] Extend pg_get_acl() to handle sub-object IDs
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加函数 <link
      linkend="functions-info-object-table"><function>pg_get_acl()</function></link> 以检索数据库访问控制详细信息（Joel Jacobson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4564f1ceb">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d898665bf">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-09-12 [4eada203a] Add has_largeobject_privilege function.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加函数 <link
      linkend="functions-info-access-table"><function>has_largeobject_privilege()</function></link> 以检查大型对象权限（Yugo Nagata）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4eada203a">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-04-04 [0d6c47766] Extend ALTER DEFAULT PRIVILEGES to define default privil
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许<xref linkend="sql-alterdefaultprivileges"/>定义大型对象默认权限（Takatsuka Haruka, Yugo Nagata, Laurenz Albe）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0d6c47766">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-07-09 [ccd38024b] Introduce pg_signal_autovacuum_worker.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加预定义角色 <link
      linkend="predefined-roles"><literal>pg_signal_autovacuum_worker</literal></link>（Kirill Reshke）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ccd38024b">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这允许向自动清理工作者发送信号。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-server-config">
     <title>服务器配置</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-02-20 [b3f0be788] Add support for OAUTHBEARER SASL mechanism
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加对 <link linkend="auth-oauth">OAuth 认证方法</link>的支持（Jacob Champion, Daniel Gustafsson, Thomas Munro）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b3f0be788">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这为 <link
      linkend="auth-pg-hba-conf"><filename>pg_hba.conf</filename></link> 添加了 <literal>oauth</literal> 认证方法、libpq OAuth 选项、一个用于加载令牌验证库的服务器变量<xref
      linkend="guc-oauth-validator-libraries"/>，以及一个 <link
      linkend="configure-option-with-libcurl"><option>--with-libcurl</option></link> 配置标志，用于添加所需的编译时库。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2024-10-24 [45188c2ea] Support configuring TLSv1.3 cipher suites
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-ssl-tls13-ciphers"/>以允许指定多个以冒号分隔的 TLSv1.3 密码套件（Erica Zhang, Daniel Gustafsson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;45188c2ea">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-03-18 [daa02c6bd] Add X25519 to the default set of curves
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-ssl-groups"/>的默认值更改为包含椭圆曲线 X25519（Daniel Gustafsson, Jacob Champion）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;daa02c6bd">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2024-10-24 [3d1ef3a15] Support configuring multiple ECDH curves
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将服务器变量 <varname>ssl_ecdh_curve</varname> 重命名为<xref
      linkend="guc-ssl-groups"/>，并允许指定多个以冒号分隔的<acronym>ECDH</acronym>曲线（Erica Zhang, Daniel Gustafsson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3d1ef3a15">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      以前的名称仍然有效。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2025-04-02 [a460251f0] Make cancel request keys longer
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2024-07-29 [9d9b9d46f] Move cancel key generation to after forking the backend
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将<link linkend="functions-admin-signal-table">取消请求密钥</link>设为 256 位（Heikki Linnakangas, Jelte Fennema-Nio）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a460251f0">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9d9b9d46f">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这只有在服务器和客户端支持本版本中引入的线协议版本3.2时才可能实现。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-01-06 [c758119e5] Allow changing autovacuum_max_workers without restarting
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-autovacuum-worker-slots"/>以指定后台工作者的最大数量（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c758119e5">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      设置此变量后，<xref linkend="guc-autovacuum-max-workers"/>可以在运行时调整到此最大值，而无需重新启动服务器。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-02-05 [306dc520b] Introduce autovacuum_vacuum_max_threshold.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许指定触发 <link linkend="autovacuum">autovacuum</link> 的死元组的固定数量（Nathan Bossart, Frédéric Yhuel）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;306dc520b">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      服务器变量是<xref
      linkend="guc-autovacuum-vacuum-max-threshold"/>。百分比仍用于触发。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-03-24 [adb5f85fa] Redefine max_files_per_process to control additionally o
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      更改服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-max-files-per-process"/>以仅限制后端打开的文件（Andres Freund）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;adb5f85fa">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      以前，postmaster 打开的文件也计入此限制。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-07-26 [0dcaea569] Introduce num_os_semaphores GUC.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-num-os-semaphores"/>以报告所需信号量的数量（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0dcaea569">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这对于操作系统配置很有用。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-19 [4f7f7b037] extension_control_path
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-05-02 [81eaaa2c4] Make "directory" setting work with extension_control_pat
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-extension-control-path"/>以指定扩展控制文件的位置（Peter Eisentraut, Matheus Alcantara）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4f7f7b037">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;81eaaa2c4">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-replication">
     <title>流复制与恢复</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-02-19 [ac0e33136] Invalidate inactive replication slots.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许使用服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-idle-replication-slot-timeout"/>自动使非活动复制槽失效（Nisha Moond, Bharath Rupireddy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ac0e33136">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-03-21 [04ff636cb] Add GUC option to control maximum active replication ori
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加服务器变量<xref
      linkend="guc-max-active-replication-origins"/>以控制最大活动复制源（Euler Taveira）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;04ff636cb">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这以前由<xref
      linkend="guc-max-replication-slots"/>控制，但这个新设置允许在需要较少槽位的情况下具有更高的源计数。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-logical">
     <title><link linkend="logical-replication">逻辑复制</link></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-10-30 [745217a05] Replicate generated columns when specified in the column
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-11-07 [7054186c4] Replicate generated columns when 'publish_generated_colu
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-12-04 [87ce27de6] Ensure stored generated columns must be published when r
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-01-30 [6252b1eaf] Doc: Generated column replication.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许<link
      linkend="sql-createtable-parms-generated-stored">生成列</link>的值进行逻辑复制（Shubham Khanna, Vignesh C, Zhijie Hou, Shlok Kyal, Peter Smith）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;745217a05">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7054186c4">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;87ce27de6">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6252b1eaf">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      如果发布指定了列列表，则发布所有指定的列（生成的和非生成的）。如果没有指定的列列表，则发布选项 <literal>publish_generated_columns</literal> 控制是否发布生成的列。以前生成的列不进行复制，订阅者必须在可能的情况下计算值；这对于缺少此类功能的非 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 订阅者特别有用。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-10-28 [1bf1140be] Change the default value of the streaming option to 'par
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将<xref linkend="sql-createsubscription"/>流式选项的默认值从 <literal>off</literal> 更改为 <literal>parallel</literal>（Vignesh C）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1bf1140be">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-07-24 [1462aad2e] Allow altering of two_phase option of a SUBSCRIPTION.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-04-03 [4868c96bc] Fix slot synchronization for two_phase enabled slots.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许<xref linkend="sql-altersubscription"/>更改复制槽的两阶段提交行为（Hayato Kuroda, Ajin Cherian, Amit Kapila, Zhijie Hou）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1462aad2e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4868c96bc">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-08-20 [9758174e2] Log the conflicts while applying changes in logical repl
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-08-22 [edcb71258] Doc: explain the log format of logical replication confl
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-08-29 [640178c92] Rename the conflict types for the origin differ cases.
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2024-09-04 [6c2b5edec] Collect statistics about conflicts in logical replicatio
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-03-24 [73eba5004] Detect and Log multiple_unique_conflicts type conflict.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      在应用逻辑复制更改时记录<link linkend="hot-standby-conflict">冲突</link>（Zhijie Hou, Nisha Moond）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9758174e2">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;edcb71258">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;640178c92">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c2b5edec">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;73eba5004">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      同时在 <link
      linkend="monitoring-pg-stat-subscription-stats"><structname>pg_stat_subscription_stats</structname></link> 的新列中报告。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-utility">
    <title>工具命令</title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-02-07 [83ea6c540] Virtual generated columns
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-28 [cdc168ad4] Add support for not-null constraints on virtual generate
Author: Richard Guo <rguo@postgresql.org>
2025-02-25 [1e4351af3] Expand virtual generated columns in the planner
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许<link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-generated-stored">生成列</link>采用虚拟形式，并将虚拟生成列设为默认形式（Peter Eisentraut, Jian He, Richard Guo, Dean Rasheed）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;83ea6c540">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cdc168ad4">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1e4351af3">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     虚拟生成列在读取时生成其值，而不是在写入时生成。写入行为仍然可以通过 <literal>STORED</literal> 选项指定。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2025-01-16 [80feb727c] Add OLD/NEW support to RETURNING in DML queries.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     为<acronym>DML</acronym>查询中的 <link
     linkend="dml-returning"><literal>RETURNING</literal></link> 添加 <literal>OLD</literal>/<literal>NEW</literal> 支持（Dean Rasheed）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;80feb727c">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>以前，<literal>RETURNING</literal>只返回<xref linkend="sql-insert"/>和<xref linkend="sql-update"/>的新值，以及<xref linkend="sql-delete"/>的旧值；<xref linkend="sql-merge"/>则根据实际执行的内部查询返回相应的值。新语法允许<command>INSERT</command>/<command>UPDATE</command>/<command>DELETE</command>/<command>MERGE</command>的<literal>RETURNING</literal>列表通过特殊别名<literal>old</literal>和<literal>new</literal>显式返回旧值和新值。这些别名可以重命名，以避免标识符冲突。</para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-19 [302cf1575] Add support for LIKE in CREATE FOREIGN TABLE
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许像现有本地表一样创建外部表（Zhang Mingli）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;302cf1575">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     语法是 <link linkend="sql-createforeigntable"><command>CREATE
     FOREIGN TABLE ... LIKE</command></link>。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-11-27 [85b7efa1c] Support LIKE with nondeterministic collations
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许 <link linkend="functions-like"><literal>LIKE</literal></link> 与<link linkend="collation-nondeterministic">非确定性排序规则</link>一起使用（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;85b7efa1c">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-02-21 [329304c90] Support text position search functions with nondetermini
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许文本位置搜索函数与非确定性排序规则一起使用（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;329304c90">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这些以前会生成错误。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-01-17 [d3d098316] Support PG_UNICODE_FAST locale in the builtin collation
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加内置排序规则提供程序 <link
     linkend="locale-providers"><literal>PG_UNICODE_FAST</literal></link>（Jeff Davis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d3d098316">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     此区域设置支持大小写映射，但按代码点顺序排序，而非自然语言顺序。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-09-24 [62ddf7ee9] Add ONLY support for VACUUM and ANALYZE
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许<xref linkend="sql-vacuum"/>和<xref linkend="sql-analyze"/>处理分区表而不处理其子表（Michael Harris）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;62ddf7ee9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这通过新的 <literal>ONLY</literal> 选项启用。这很有用，因为自动清理不处理分区表，只处理其子表。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2024-10-11 [e839c8ecc] Create functions pg_set_relation_stats, pg_clear_relatio
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2024-10-24 [d32d14639] Add functions pg_restore_relation_stats(), pg_restore_at
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [650ab8aaf] Stats: use schemaname/relname instead of regclass.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数以修改每关系和每列优化器统计信息（Corey Huinker）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e839c8ecc">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d32d14639">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;650ab8aaf">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这些函数是 <link
     linkend="functions-admin-statsmod"><function>pg_restore_relation_stats()</function></link>、<function>pg_restore_attribute_stats()</function>、<function>pg_clear_relation_stats()</function> 和 <function>pg_clear_attribute_stats()</function>。
     </para>
     </listitem>


<!--
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2025-04-08 [f78ca6f3e] Introduce file_copy_method setting.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加服务器变量<xref linkend="guc-file-copy-method"/>以控制文件复制方法（Nazir Bilal Yavuz）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f78ca6f3e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这控制 <link
     linkend="sql-createdatabase"><command>CREATE DATABASE
     ... STRATEGY=FILE_COPY</command></link> 和 <link
     linkend="sql-alterdatabase"><command>ALTER DATABASE ... SET
     TABLESPACE</command></link> 是使用文件复制还是克隆。
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

    <sect4 id="release-18-constraints">
     <title><link linkend="ddl-constraints">约束</link></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-09-17 [fc0438b4e] Add temporal PRIMARY KEY and UNIQUE constraints
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-09-17 [89f908a6d] Add temporal FOREIGN KEY contraints
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许指定不重叠的 <link
      linkend="sql-createtable-parms-primary-key"><literal>PRIMARY
      KEY</literal></link>、<link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-unique">
      <literal>UNIQUE</literal></link> 和<link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-references">外键</link>约束（Paul A. Jungwirth）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fc0438b4e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;89f908a6d">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这通过 <literal>WITHOUT OVERLAPS</literal> 用于 <literal>PRIMARY KEY</literal> 和 <literal>UNIQUE</literal>，并通过 <literal>PERIOD</literal> 用于外键，所有这些都应用于最后一个指定的列。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-01-11 [ca87c415e] Add support for NOT ENFORCED in CHECK constraints
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-04-02 [eec0040c4] Add support for NOT ENFORCED in foreign key constraints
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许将 <link
      linkend="sql-createtable-parms-check"><literal>CHECK</literal></link> 和<link linkend="sql-createtable-parms-references">外键</link>约束指定为 <literal>NOT
      ENFORCED</literal>（Amul Sul）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ca87c415e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;eec0040c4">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这还添加了列 <link
      linkend="catalog-pg-constraint"><structname>pg_constraint</structname></link>.<structfield>conenforced</structfield>。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-11-15 [9321d2fdf] Fix collation handling for foreign keys
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      要求<link
      linkend="sql-createtable-parms-references">主键/外键</link>关系使用确定性排序规则或相同的非确定性排序规则（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9321d2fdf">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      如果这些要求不满足，<xref linkend="app-pgdump"/>的恢复（<xref
      linkend="pgupgrade"/>也使用）将失败；必须对模式进行更改才能使这些升级方法成功。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2024-11-08 [14e87ffa5] Add pg_constraint rows for not-null constraints
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
Branch: master Release: REL_18_BR [81ce602d4] 2025-06-26 20:25:34 +0900
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将列 <link
      linkend="sql-createtable-parms-not-null"><literal>NOT
      NULL</literal></link> 规范存储在 <link
      linkend="catalog-pg-constraint"><structname>pg_constraint</structname></link> 中（Álvaro Herrera, Bernd Helmle）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;14e87ffa5">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;81ce602d4">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这允许为 <literal>NOT NULL</literal> 约束指定名称。这还向外部表添加了 <literal>NOT NULL</literal> 约束，并向本地表添加了 <literal>NOT NULL</literal> 继承控制。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-04-07 [a379061a2] Allow NOT NULL constraints to be added as NOT VALID
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许<xref linkend="sql-altertable"/>设置 <literal>NOT NULL</literal> 约束的 <literal>NOT
      VALID</literal> 属性（Rushabh Lathia, Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a379061a2">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-03-05 [f4e53e10b] Add ALTER TABLE ... ALTER CONSTRAINT ... SET [NO] INHERI
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-03-27 [4a02af8b1] Simplify syntax for ALTER TABLE ALTER CONSTRAINT NO INHE
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许修改 <literal>NOT
      NULL</literal> 约束的可继承性（Suraj Kharage, Álvaro Herrera）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f4e53e10b">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4a02af8b1">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      语法是 <link linkend="sql-altertable"><command>ALTER TABLE
      ... ALTER CONSTRAINT ... [NO] INHERIT</command></link>。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-01-23 [b663b9436] Allow NOT VALID foreign key constraints on partitioned t
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许分区表上的 <literal>NOT VALID</literal> 外键约束（Amul Sul）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b663b9436">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2024-09-30 [4dea33ce7] Don't disallow DROP of constraints ONLY on partitioned t
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许在分区表上使用 <literal>ONLY</literal> <link linkend="sql-altertable-desc-drop-constraint">丢弃</link>约束（Álvaro Herrera）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4dea33ce7">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

      <para>
      这以前被错误地禁止了。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-copy">
     <title><xref linkend="sql-copy"/></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-10-08 [4ac2a9bec] Add REJECT_LIMIT option to the COPY command.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <literal>REJECT_LIMIT</literal> 以控制 <command>COPY FROM</command> 可以忽略的无效行数（Atsushi Torikoshi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4ac2a9bec">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这在 <literal>ON_ERROR = 'ignore'</literal> 时可用。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-04-04 [534874fac] Allow "COPY table TO" command to copy rows from material
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许 <command>COPY TO</command> 从已填充的物化视图复制行（Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;534874fac">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-10-03 [e7834a1a2] Add LOG_VERBOSITY = 'silent' support to COPY command.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <command>COPY</command> <literal>LOG_VERBOSITY</literal> 级别 <literal>silent</literal> 以抑制被忽略行的日志输出（Atsushi Torikoshi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e7834a1a2">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      当 <literal>on_error = 'ignore'</literal> 时，此新级别会抑制与被丢弃输入行有关的消息输出。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-02-06 [401a6956f] Disallow COPY FREEZE on foreign tables.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      禁止在外部表上 <command>COPY FREEZE</command>（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;401a6956f">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      以前，<command>COPY</command> 可以工作，但 <literal>FREEZE</literal> 会被忽略，所以禁止此命令。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-explain">
     <title><xref linkend="sql-explain"/></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-12-11 [c2a4078eb] Enable BUFFERS with EXPLAIN ANALYZE by default
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      自动将 <literal>BUFFERS</literal> 输出包含在 <command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command> 中（Guillaume Lelarge, David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c2a4078eb">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-17 [320545bfc] Add information about WAL buffers being full to EXPLAIN
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加完整<acronym>WAL</acronym>缓冲区计数到 <command>EXPLAIN
      (WAL)</command> 输出（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;320545bfc">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Geoghegan <pg@bowt.ie>
2025-03-11 [0fbceae84] Show index search count in EXPLAIN ANALYZE, take 2.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      在 <command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command> 中，报告每个索引扫描节点使用的索引查找次数（Peter Geoghegan）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0fbceae84">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-02-21 [ddb17e387] Allow EXPLAIN to indicate fractional rows.
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-02-27 [95dbd827f] EXPLAIN: Always use two fractional digits for row counts
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      修改 <command>EXPLAIN</command> 以输出小数行计数（Ibrar Ahmed, Ilia Evdokimov, Robert Haas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ddb17e387">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;95dbd827f">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-07-05 [1eff8279d] Add memory/disk usage for Material nodes in EXPLAIN
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-07-05 [53abb1e0e] Fix newly introduced issue in EXPLAIN for Materialize no
Author: Tatsuo Ishii <ishii@postgresql.org>
2024-09-17 [95d6e9af0] Add memory/disk usage for Window aggregate nodes in EXPL
Author: Tatsuo Ishii <ishii@postgresql.org>
2024-09-23 [40708acd6] Add memory/disk usage for more executor nodes.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      在 <command>EXPLAIN</command> 输出中，为 <literal>Material</literal>、<literal>Window Aggregate</literal> 和通用表表达式节点添加内存和磁盘使用详情（David Rowley, Tatsuo Ishii）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1eff8279d">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;53abb1e0e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;95d6e9af0">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;40708acd6">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>


<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-03-11 [8b1b34254] Improve EXPLAIN's display of window functions.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将窗口函数参数的详细信息添加到 <command>EXPLAIN</command> 输出（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8b1b34254">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-07-09 [5a1e6df3b] Show Parallel Bitmap Heap Scan worker stats in EXPLAIN A
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      将 <literal>Parallel Bitmap Heap Scan</literal> 工作者缓存统计信息添加到 <command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command>（David Geier, Heikki Linnakangas, Donghang Lin, Alena Rybakina, David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5a1e6df3b">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2024-08-21 [c01743aa4] Show number of disabled nodes in EXPLAIN ANALYZE output.
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-10-11 [161320b4b] Adjust EXPLAIN's output for disabled nodes
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-10-29 [84b8fccbe] Doc: add detail about EXPLAIN's "Disabled" property
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      在 <command>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</command> 输出中指示已禁用节点（Robert Haas, David Rowley, Laurenz Albe）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c01743aa4">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;161320b4b">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;84b8fccbe">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-datatypes">
    <title>数据类型</title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-01-23 [4e7f62bc3] Add support for Unicode case folding.
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-01-17 [286a365b9] Support Unicode full case mapping and conversion.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     改进 <link linkend="collation-managing-standard">Unicode</link> 全大小写映射和转换（Jeff Davis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4e7f62bc3">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;286a365b9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这增加了进行条件和标题大小写映射的能力，以及将单个字符大小写映射到多个字符的能力。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-01-24 [a5579a90a] Make jsonb casts to scalar types translate JSON null to
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许在将 <link linkend="datatype-json"><type>jsonb</type></link> <literal>null</literal> 值转换为标量类型时返回 <literal>NULL</literal>（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a5579a90a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     以前这样的转换会产生错误。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Andrew Dunstan <andrew@dunslane.net>
2025-03-05 [4603903d2] Allow json{b}_strip_nulls() to remove null array elements
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     向 <link
     linkend="functions-json-processing-table"><function>json{b}_strip_nulls</function></link> 添加可选参数，以允许删除数组中的空值元素（Florents Tselai）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4603903d2">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-04-01 [6c12ae09f] Introduce a SQL-callable function array_sort(anyarray).
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数 <link
     linkend="array-functions-table"><function>array_sort()</function></link>，它对数组的第一维进行排序（Junwang Zhao, Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c12ae09f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-11-01 [49d6c7d8d] Add SQL function array_reverse()
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数 <link
     linkend="array-functions-table"><function>array_reverse()</function></link>，它反转数组的第一维（Aleksander Alekseev）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;49d6c7d8d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-13 [0697b2390] Add reverse(bytea).
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数 <link
     linkend="functions-string-other"><function>reverse()</function></link> 以反转 bytea 字节（Aleksander Alekseev）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0697b2390">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2025-03-07 [6da469bad] Allow casting between bytea and integer types.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许在整数类型和 <link
     linkend="datatype-binary"><type>bytea</type></link> 之间进行转换（Aleksander Alekseev）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6da469bad">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     整数值存储为 <type>bytea</type> 二进制补码值。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-04-03 [82a46cca9] Update Unicode data to Unicode 16.0.0
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     更新 Unicode 数据至 <link
     linkend="collation-managing-standard">Unicode</link> 16.0.0（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;82a46cca9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-02-18 [b464e51ab] Update to latest Snowball sources.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加爱沙尼亚语的全文检索<link
     linkend="textsearch-snowball-dictionary">词干提取</link>（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b464e51ab">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-09-24 [cd838e200] Neaten up our choices of SQLSTATEs for XML-related error
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     改进 <link linkend="datatype-xml"><type>XML</type></link> 错误代码以更接近<acronym>SQL</acronym>标准（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cd838e200">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这些错误通过 <link
     linkend="errcodes-appendix"><literal>SQLSTATE</literal></link> 报告。
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-functions">
    <title>函数</title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-01-24 [bfc599206] Add SQL function CASEFOLD().
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数 <link
     linkend="functions-string-other"><function>casefold()</function></link> 以允许更复杂的忽略大小写匹配（Jeff Davis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bfc599206">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这允许更准确的比较，即一个字符可以有多个大写或小写等价物，或者大写或小写转换会改变字符的数量。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-07-11 [a0f1fce80] Add min and max aggregates for composite types (records)
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-10-08 [2d24fd942] Add min and max aggregates for bytea type.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许在数组和复合类型上进行 <link
     linkend="functions-aggregate-table"><function>MIN()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-aggregate-table"><function>MAX()</function></link> 聚合（Aleksander Alekseev, Marat Buharov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a0f1fce80">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2d24fd942">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-08-16 [6be39d77a] Fix extraction of week and quarter fields from intervals
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     向 <link
     linkend="functions-datetime-extract"><function>EXTRACT()</function></link> 添加 <literal>WEEK</literal> 选项（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6be39d77a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-08-16 [6be39d77a] Fix extraction of week and quarter fields from intervals
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     改进 <literal>EXTRACT(QUARTER ...)</literal> 对负值的输出（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6be39d77a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-01-22 [172e6b3ad] Support RN (roman-numeral format) in to_number().
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     向 <link
     linkend="functions-formatting-table"><function>to_number()</function></link> 添加罗马数字支持（Hunaid Sohail）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;172e6b3ad">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这通过 <literal>RN</literal> 模式访问。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2024-12-11 [78c5e141e] Add UUID version 7 generation function.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 <link linkend="datatype-uuid"><type>UUID</type></link> 版本7生成函数 <link
     linkend="func_uuid_gen_table"><function>uuidv7()</function></link>（Andrey Borodin）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;78c5e141e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     此 <type>UUID</type> 值可按时间排序。已添加函数别名 <link
     linkend="func_uuid_gen_table"><function>uuidv4()</function></link> 以显式生成版本4 UUID。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-08-12 [760162fed] Add user-callable CRC functions.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数 <link
     linkend="functions-binarystring-other"><function>crc32()</function></link> 和 <link
     linkend="functions-binarystring-other"><function>crc32c()</function></link> 以计算<acronym>CRC</acronym>值（Aleksander Alekseev）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;760162fed">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2025-03-26 [a3b6dfd41] Add support for gamma() and lgamma() functions.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加数学函数 <link
     linkend="functions-math-func-table"><function>gamma()</function></link> 和 <link
     linkend="functions-math-func-table"><function>lgamma()</function></link>（Dean Rasheed）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a3b6dfd41">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-03-03 [246dedc5d] Allow =&gt; syntax for named cursor arguments in plpgsql.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许在 <link linkend="plpgsql">PL/pgSQL</link> 中使用 <literal>=&gt;</literal> 语法指定具名游标参数（Pavel Stehule）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;246dedc5d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     我们以前只接受 <literal>:=</literal>。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-07-25 [580f8727c] Add argument names to the regexp_XXX functions.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许 <link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_match[es]()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_like()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_replace()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_count()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_instr()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_substr()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_split_to_table()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="functions-posix-regexp"><function>regexp_split_to_array()</function></link> 使用命名参数（Jian He）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;580f8727c">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-libpq">
    <title><link linkend="libpq">Libpq</link></title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2024-09-09 [cdb6b0fdb] Add PQfullProtocolVersion() to surface the precise proto
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数 <link linkend="libpq-PQfullProtocolVersion"><function>PQfullProtocolVersion()</function></link> 以报告完整的（包括次要版本）协议版本号（Jacob Champion, Jelte Fennema-Nio）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cdb6b0fdb">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2025-04-02 [285613c60] libpq: Add min/max_protocol_version connection options
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2025-04-02 [507034910] libpq: Handle NegotiateProtocolVersion message different
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 libpq 连接<link
     linkend="libpq-connect-ssl-max-protocol-version">参数</link>和<link linkend="libpq-envars">环境变量</link>以指定连接的最小和最大可接受协议版本（Jelte Fennema-Nio）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;285613c60">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;507034910">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2024-08-19 [28a1121fd] Mark search_path as GUC_REPORT
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2024-08-19 [0d06a7eac] Document that search_path is reported by the server
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     向客户端报告<xref linkend="guc-search-path"/>更改（Alexander Kukushkin, Jelte Fennema-Nio, Tomas Vondra）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;28a1121fd">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0d06a7eac">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2024-08-12 [ea92f3a0a] libpq: Trace frontend authentication challenges
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2024-08-14 [a5c6b8f22] libpq: Trace responses to SSLRequest and GSSENCRequest
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2024-08-16 [b8b3f861f] libpq: Trace all messages received from the server
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-02-24 [e87c14b19] libpq: Trace all NegotiateProtocolVersion fields
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2024-08-09 [7adec2d5f] libpq: Trace StartupMessage/SSLRequest/GSSENCRequest cor
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 <link
     linkend="libpq-PQtrace"><function>PQtrace()</function></link> 输出，用于所有消息类型，包括认证（Jelte Fennema-Nio）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ea92f3a0a">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a5c6b8f22">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b8b3f861f">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e87c14b19">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7adec2d5f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-04-03 [2da74d8d6] libpq: Add support for dumping SSL key material to file
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 libpq 连接参数 <link
     linkend="libpq-connect-sslkeylogfile"><varname>sslkeylogfile</varname></link>，该参数会转储<acronym>SSL</acronym>密钥材料（Abhishek Chanda, Daniel Gustafsson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2da74d8d6">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这对于调试很有用。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [3c86223c9] libpq: Deprecate pg_int64.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     修改一些 libpq 函数签名以使用 <literal>int64_t</literal>（Thomas Munro）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3c86223c9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这些以前使用 <literal>pg_int64</literal>，现已弃用。
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-psql">
    <title><xref linkend="app-psql"/></title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-08-22 [d55322b0d] psql: Add more meta-commands able to use the extended pr
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
Branch: master Release: REL_18_BR [fc39b286a] 2025-06-24 13:12:46 +0900
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许 <application>psql</application> 解析、绑定和关闭命名预处理语句（Anthonin Bonnefoy, Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d55322b0d">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fc39b286a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这通过新命令 <link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-parse"><literal>\parse</literal></link>、<link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-bind-named"><literal>\bind_named</literal></link> 和 <link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-close-prepared"><literal>\close_prepared</literal></link> 完成。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-21 [41625ab8e] psql: Add support for pipelines
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-03-18 [17caf6644] psql: Add \sendpipeline to send query buffers while in a
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-03-19 [2cce0fe44] psql: Allow queries terminated by semicolons while in pi
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 <application>psql</application> 反斜杠命令以允许发出管道查询（Anthonin Bonnefoy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;41625ab8e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;17caf6644">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2cce0fe44">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     新命令是 <link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-pipeline"><literal>\startpipeline</literal></link>、<literal>\syncpipeline</literal>、<literal>\sendpipeline</literal>、<literal>\endpipeline</literal>、<literal>\flushrequest</literal>、<literal>\flush</literal> 和 <literal>\getresults</literal>。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-25 [3ce357584] psql: Add pipeline status to prompt and some state varia
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许将管道状态添加到 <application>psql</application> 提示符并添加相关状态变量（Anthonin Bonnefoy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3ce357584">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     新的提示符字符是 <literal>%P</literal>，新的 <application>psql</application> 变量是 <link
     linkend="app-psql-variables-pipeline-sync-count"><literal>PIPELINE_SYNC_COUNT</literal></link>、<link
     linkend="app-psql-variables-pipeline-command-count"><literal>PIPELINE_COMMAND_COUNT</literal></link> 和 <link
     linkend="app-psql-variables-pipeline-result-count"><literal>PIPELINE_RESULT_COUNT</literal></link>。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-12-18 [477728b5d] psql: Add more information about service name
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许将连接服务名称添加到 <application>psql</application> 提示符或通过 <application>psql</application> 变量访问它（Michael Banck）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;477728b5d">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2025-01-14 [00f4c2959] psql: Add option to use expanded mode to all list comman
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 <application>psql</application> 选项，在所有列表命令上使用扩展模式（Dean Rasheed）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;00f4c2959">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     添加反斜杠后缀 <literal>x</literal> 启用此功能。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-02-22 [bba2fbc62] Change \conninfo to use tabular format
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     更改 <application>psql</application> 的<xref
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-conninfo"/>以使用表格格式并包含更多信息（Álvaro Herrera, Maiquel Grassi, Hunaid Sohail）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bba2fbc62">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2025-01-14 [2355e5111] psql: Add leakproof indicator to \df+, \do+, \dAo+, and
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     将函数的防泄漏指示器添加到 <application>psql</application> 的 <link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-df-lc"><literal>\df+</literal></link>、<literal>\do+</literal>、<literal>\dAo+</literal> 和 <literal>\dC+</literal> 输出（Yugo Nagata）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2355e5111">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-07-02 [978f38c77] Add information about access method for partitioned rela
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     在 <link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-dp-uc"><literal>\dP+</literal></link> 中为分区关系添加访问方法详细信息（Justin Pryzby）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;978f38c77">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Magnus Hagander <magnus@hagander.net>
2025-03-24 [d696406a9] psql: show default extension version in \dx output
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     将 <literal>default_version</literal> 添加到 <application>psql</application> <link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-dx-lc"><literal>\dx</literal></link> 扩展输出（Magnus Hagander）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d696406a9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [1a759c832] psql: Make default \watch interval configurable
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 <application>psql</application> 变量<xref
     linkend="app-psql-variables-watch-interval"/>以设置默认的 <link
     linkend="app-psql-meta-command-watch"><literal>\watch</literal></link> 等待时间（Daniel Gustafsson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1a759c832">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-server-apps">
    <title>服务器应用</title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-10-01 [983a588e0] initdb: Add new option "- -no-data-checksums"
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-10-16 [04bec894a] initdb: Change default to using data checksums.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     更改<xref linkend="app-initdb"/>默认启用校验和（Greg Sabino Mullane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;983a588e0">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;04bec894a">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     新的 <application>initdb</application> 选项 <option>--no-data-checksums</option> 禁用校验和。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [cf131fa94] initdb: Add - -no-sync-data-files.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加 <application>initdb</application> 选项 <option>--no-sync-data-files</option> 以避免同步堆/索引文件（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cf131fa94">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     <application>initdb</application> 选项 <option>--no-sync</option> 仍然可用，以避免同步任何文件。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-18 [edba754f0] vacuumdb: Add option for analyzing only relations missin
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-04-30 [987910502] vacuumdb: Don't skip empty relations in - -missing-stats-
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加<xref linkend="app-vacuumdb"/>选项 <option>--missing-stats-only</option> 以仅计算缺失的优化器统计信息（Corey Huinker, Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;edba754f0">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;987910502">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     此选项只能由超级用户运行，并且只能与选项 <option>--analyze-only</option> 和 <option>--analyze-in-stages</option> 一起使用。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-03-17 [99aeb8470] pg_combinebackup: Add -k, - -link option.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加<xref linkend="app-pgcombinebackup"/>选项 <option>-k</option>/<option>--link</option> 以启用硬链接（Israel Barth Rubio, Robert Haas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;99aeb8470">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     只有某些文件可以硬链接。如果备份将独立使用，则不应使用此功能。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2024-09-27 [8dfd31290] pg_verifybackup: Verify tar-format backups.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许<xref linkend="app-pgverifybackup"/>验证 tar 格式备份（Amul Sul）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8dfd31290">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-03-12 [4ecdd4110] pg_rewind: Add dbname to primary_conninfo when using - -w
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     如果<xref linkend="app-pgrewind"/>的 <option>--source-server</option> 指定了数据库名称，则在 <option>--write-recovery-conf</option> 输出中使用它（Masahiko Sawada）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4ecdd4110">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-02-21 [30666d185] pg_resetwal: Add - -char-signedness option to change the
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加<xref linkend="app-pgresetwal"/>选项 <option>--char-signedness</option> 以更改默认的 <type>char</type> 有符号性（Masahiko Sawada）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;30666d185">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>


    <sect4 id="release-18-pgdump">
     <title><link
     linkend="app-pgdump"><application>pg_dump</application></link>/<link
     linkend="app-pg-dumpall"><application>pg_dumpall</application></link>/<link
     linkend="app-pgrestore"><application>pg_restore</application></link></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [bde2fb797] Add pg_dump - -with-{schema|data|statistics} options.
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-08-02 [a3e8dc143] Simplify options in pg_dump and pg_restore.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<xref linkend="app-pgdump"/>选项 <option>--statistics</option>（Jeff Davis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bde2fb797">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a3e8dc143">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [9c49f0e8c] pg_dump: Add - -sequence-data.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-05-07 [acea3fc49] pg_dumpall: Add - -sequence-data.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <application>pg_dump</application> 和<xref
      linkend="app-pg-dumpall"/>选项 <option>--sequence-data</option> 以转储通常会被排除的序列数据（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9c49f0e8c">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;acea3fc49">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-02-20 [1fd1bd871] Transfer statistics during pg_upgrade.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<xref linkend="app-pgdump"/>、<xref linkend="app-pg-dumpall"/>和<xref linkend="app-pgrestore"/>选项 <option>--statistics-only</option>、<option>--no-statistics</option>、<option>--no-data</option> 和 <option>--no-schema</option>（Corey Huinker, Jeff Davis）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1fd1bd871">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-03-16 [cd3c45125] pg_dump, pg_dumpall, pg_restore: Add - -no-policies optio
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加选项 <option>--no-policies</option> 以禁用<xref linkend="app-pgdump"/>、<xref linkend="app-pg-dumpall"/>、<xref linkend="app-pgrestore"/>中的行级安全策略处理（Nikolay Samokhvalov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cd3c45125">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这对于迁移到具有不同策略的系统很有用。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-pgupgrade">
     <title><xref linkend="pgupgrade"/></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-02-20 [1fd1bd871] Transfer statistics during pg_upgrade.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-18 [c9d502eb6] Update guidance for running vacuumdb after pg_upgrade.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-04-30 [d5f1b6a75] Further adjust guidance for running vacuumdb after pg_up
Author: Jeff Davis <jdavis@postgresql.org>
2025-02-20 [1fd1bd871] Transfer statistics during pg_upgrade.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许 <application>pg_upgrade</application> 保留优化器统计信息（Corey Huinker, Jeff Davis, Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1fd1bd871">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c9d502eb6">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;d5f1b6a75">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1fd1bd871">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      不保留扩展统计信息。同时添加 <application>pg_upgrade</application> 选项 <option>--no-statistics</option> 以禁用统计信息保留。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [40e2e5e92] Introduce framework for parallelizing various pg_upgrade
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [6d3d2e8e5] pg_upgrade: Parallelize retrieving relation information.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [7baa36de5] pg_upgrade: Parallelize subscription check.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [46cad8b31] pg_upgrade: Parallelize retrieving loadable libraries.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [6ab8f27bc] pg_upgrade: Parallelize retrieving extension updates.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [bbf83cab9] pg_upgrade: Parallelize data type checks.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [9db3018cf] pg_upgrade: Parallelize contrib/isn check.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [c34eabfbb] pg_upgrade: Parallelize postfix operator check.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [cf2f82a37] pg_upgrade: Parallelize incompatible polymorphics check.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [f93f5f7b9] pg_upgrade: Parallelize WITH OIDS check.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-16 [c880cf258] pg_upgrade: Parallelize encoding conversion check.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许 <application>pg_upgrade</application> 并行处理数据库检查（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;40e2e5e92">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6d3d2e8e5">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7baa36de5">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;46cad8b31">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6ab8f27bc">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;bbf83cab9">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9db3018cf">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c34eabfbb">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cf2f82a37">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f93f5f7b9">&sect;</ulink>
      <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c880cf258">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

      <para>
      这由现有 <option>--jobs</option> 选项控制。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [626d7236b] pg_upgrade: Add - -swap for faster file transfer.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <application>pg_upgrade</application> 选项 <option>--swap</option> 以交换目录而不是复制、克隆或链接文件（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;626d7236b">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      此模式可能是最快的。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-02-21 [a8238f87f] pg_upgrade: Preserve default char signedness value from
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-02-21 [1aab68059] pg_upgrade: Add - -set-char-signedness to set the default
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <application>pg_upgrade</application> 选项 <option>--set-char-signedness</option> 以设置新集簇的默认 <type>char</type> 符号性（Masahiko Sawada）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a8238f87f">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;1aab68059">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这是为了处理 <productname>PostgreSQL</productname> 18 之前集簇的默认<acronym>CPU</acronym>符号性与新集簇不匹配的情况。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-logicalrep-app">
     <title>逻辑复制应用程序</title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-03-28 [fb2ea12f4] pg_createsubscriber: Add '- -all' option.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<xref linkend="app-pgcreatesubscriber"/>选项 <option>--all</option> 以创建所有数据库的逻辑副本（Shubham Khanna）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fb2ea12f4">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-03-20 [e5aeed4b8] pg_createsubscriber: Add -R publications option.
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
Branch: master Release: REL_18_BR [60dda7bbc] 2025-06-25 10:50:43 +0200
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <application>pg_createsubscriber</application> 选项 <option>--clean</option> 以删除发布（Shubham Khanna）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e5aeed4b8">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;60dda7bbc">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Amit Kapila <akapila@postgresql.org>
2025-02-26 [e117cfb2f] Add two-phase option in pg_createsubscriber.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加 <application>pg_createsubscriber</application> 选项 <option>--enable-two-phase</option> 以启用预备事务（Shubham Khanna）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e117cfb2f">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-04-04 [cf2655a90] pg_recvlogical: Add - -failover option.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<xref linkend="app-pgrecvlogical"/>选项 <option>--enable-failover</option> 以指定故障切换槽（Hayato Kuroda）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cf2655a90">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      还添加选项 <option>--enable-two-phase</option> 作为 <option>--two-phase</option> 的同义词，并弃用后者。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-03-25 [c68100aa4] Allow pg_recvlogical - -drop-slot to work without - -dbnam
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许 <application>pg_recvlogical</application> <option>--drop-slot</option> 在没有 <option>--dbname</option> 的情况下工作（Hayato Kuroda）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c68100aa4">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-source-code">
    <title>源代码</title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-07-05 [4b211003e] Support loading of injection points
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-07-18 [a0a5869a8] Add INJECTION_POINT_CACHED() to run injection points dir
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     分离<link
     linkend="xfunc-addin-injection-points">注入点</link>的加载和运行（Michael Paquier, Heikki Linnakangas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4b211003e">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a0a5869a8">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     现在可以通过 <link
     linkend="xfunc-addin-injection-points"><function>INJECTION_POINT_LOAD()</function></link> 创建注入点但不运行，并且可以通过 <link
     linkend="xfunc-addin-injection-points"><function>INJECTION_POINT_CACHED()</function></link> 运行这些注入点。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-05-10 [371f2db8b] Add support for runtime arguments in injection points
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     支持注入点中的运行时参数（Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;371f2db8b">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2024-07-26 [20e0e7da9] Add test for early backend startup errors
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许使用 <link
     linkend="xfunc-addin-injection-points"><function>IS_INJECTION_POINT_ATTACHED()</function></link> 的内联注入点测试代码（Heikki Linnakangas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;20e0e7da9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-08-05 [ca6fde922] Optimize JSON escaping using SIMD
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     使用 <acronym>SIMD</acronym>（单指令多数据）改进处理长<link
     linkend="datatype-json"><type>JSON</type></link>字符串的性能（David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ca6fde922">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: John Naylor <john.naylor@postgresql.org>
2025-04-06 [3c6e8c123] Compute CRC32C using AVX-512 instructions where availabl
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     使用 x86 <acronym>AVX</acronym>-512 指令加速 CRC32C 计算（Raghuveer Devulapalli, Paul Amonson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3c6e8c123">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-28 [6be53c276] Optimize popcount functions with ARM Neon intrinsics.
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-03-28 [519338ace] Optimize popcount functions with ARM SVE intrinsics.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加用于 popcount（整数位计数）的<acronym>ARM</acronym> Neon 和<acronym>SVE CPU</acronym>内在函数（Chiranmoy Bhattacharya, Devanga Susmitha, Rama Malladi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6be53c276">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;519338ace">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2024-07-09 [ca481d3c9] Optimise numeric multiplication for short inputs.
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2024-08-15 [c4e44224c] Extend mul_var_short() to 5 and 6-digit inputs.
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2024-08-15 [8dc28d7eb] Optimise numeric multiplication using base-NBASE^2 arith
Author: Dean Rasheed <dean.a.rasheed@gmail.com>
2024-10-04 [9428c001f] Speed up numeric division by always using the "fast" alg
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     提高数值乘法和除法的速度（Joel Jacobson, Dean Rasheed）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ca481d3c9">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c4e44224c">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8dc28d7eb">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9428c001f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2025-04-07 [65c298f61] Add support for basic NUMA awareness
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2025-04-07 [8cc139bec] Introduce pg_shmem_allocations_numa view
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2025-04-07 [ba2a3c230] Add pg_buffercache_numa view with NUMA node info
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加配置选项<link
     linkend="configure-option-with-libnuma"><option>--with-libnuma</option></link>以启用<acronym>NUMA</acronym>感知功能（Jakub Wartak, Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;65c298f61">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8cc139bec">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ba2a3c230">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     函数<link linkend="functions-info-session-table"><function>pg_numa_available()</function></link>
     报告是否具备<acronym>NUMA</acronym>感知能力；系统视图
     <link linkend="view-pg-shmem-allocations-numa"><structname>pg_shmem_allocations_numa</structname></link>
     和<link linkend="pgbuffercache-pg-buffercache-numa"><structname>pg_buffercache_numa</structname></link>
     报告共享内存在<acronym>NUMA</acronym>节点之间的分布。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2024-09-18 [b52c4fc3c] Add TOAST table to pg_index.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     将<link
     linkend="storage-toast"><acronym>TOAST</acronym></link>表添加到<link
     linkend="catalog-pg-index"><structname>pg_index</structname></link>，以允许创建超大型表达式索引（Nathan Bossart）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;b52c4fc3c">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: David Rowley <drowley@postgresql.org>
2024-12-20 [02a8d0c45] Remove pg_attribute.attcacheoff column
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     移除列<link
     linkend="catalog-pg-attribute"><structname>pg_attribute</structname></link>.<structfield>attcacheoff</structfield>（David Rowley）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;02a8d0c45">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Melanie Plageman <melanieplageman@gmail.com>
2025-03-03 [99f8f3fbb] Add relallfrozen to pg_class
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加列<link
     linkend="catalog-pg-class"><structname>pg_class</structname></link>.<structfield>relallfrozen</structfield>（Melanie Plageman）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;99f8f3fbb">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-09-10 [56fead44d] Add amgettreeheight index AM API routine
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-07 [af4002b38] Rename amcancrosscompare
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     将<link
     linkend="indexam"><structfield>amgettreeheight</structfield></link>、<literal>amconsistentequality</literal>和<literal>amconsistentordering</literal>添加到索引访问方法<acronym>API</acronym>（Mark Dilger）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;56fead44d">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;af4002b38">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-09-17 [7406ab623] Add stratnum GiST support function
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加GiST支持函数<link
     linkend="gist-extensibility"><function>stratnum()</function></link>（Paul A. Jungwirth）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7406ab623">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2025-02-21 [44fe30fda] Add default_char_signedness field to ControlFileData.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     在<xref linkend="app-pgcontroldata"/>中记录<acronym>CPU</acronym>对<literal>char</literal>类型的默认有符号性（Masahiko Sawada）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;44fe30fda">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-12 [72a3d0462] Prepare for Python "Limited API" in PL/Python
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-14 [0793ab810] Activate Python "Limited API" in PL/Python
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     在<link linkend="plpython">PL/Python</link>中添加对 Python“Limited <acronym>API</acronym>”的支持（Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;72a3d0462">&sect;</ulink><ulink url="&commit_baseurl;0793ab810">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这有助于防止由于<application>Python</application> 3.x 版本不匹配引起的问题。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
2025-04-29 [45363fca6] Bump the minimum supported Python version to 3.6.8
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     将最低支持的<application>Python</application>版本更改为3.6.8（Jacob Champion）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;45363fca6">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2024-09-02 [a70e01d43] Remove support for OpenSSL older than 1.1.0
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2024-10-24 [6c66b7443] Raise the minimum supported OpenSSL version to 1.1.1
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     移除对早于1.1.1版本的<application>OpenSSL</application>的支持（Daniel Gustafsson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a70e01d43">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c66b7443">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-10-01 [972c2cd28] jit: Require at least LLVM 14, if enabled.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     如果启用<application>LLVM</application>，则要求版本14或更高（Thomas Munro）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;972c2cd28">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-03-26 [9324c8c58] Introduce PG_MODULE_MAGIC_EXT macro.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加宏<link
     linkend="functions-info"><literal>PG_MODULE_MAGIC_EXT</literal></link>以允许扩展报告其名称和版本（Andrei Lepikhov）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9324c8c58">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     此信息可以通过新函数<link
     linkend="functions-info-session-table"><function>pg_get_loaded_modules()</function></link>访问。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-09-09 [218527d01] Don't bother checking the result of SPI_connect[_ext] an
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     文档指出<link
     linkend="spi-spi-connect"><function>SPI_connect()</function></link>/<link
     linkend="spi-spi-connect"><function>SPI_connect_ext()</function></link>总是返回成功（<literal>SPI_OK_CONNECT</literal>）（Stepan Neretin）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;218527d01">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     错误总是通过<function>ereport()</function>报告。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2024-07-31 [e54a42ac9] Add API and ABI stability guidance to the C language doc
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加关于<acronym>API</acronym>和<acronym>ABI</acronym>兼容性的<link linkend="xfunc-api-abi-stability-guidance">文档章节</link>（David Wheeler, Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e54a42ac9">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-01-27 [5afaba629] doc: Meson is not experimental on Windows
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     移除<application>Meson</application>上<systemitem
     class="osname">Windows</systemitem>构建的实验性标记（Aleksander Alekseev）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;5afaba629">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2024-07-30 [e25626677] Remove - -disable-spinlocks.
Author: Thomas Munro <tmunro@postgresql.org>
2024-07-30 [813852613] Remove - -disable-atomics, require 32 bit atomics.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     移除配置选项<option>--disable-spinlocks</option>和<option>--disable-atomics</option>（Thomas Munro）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e25626677">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;813852613">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     现在需要32位原子操作。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2024-07-01 [edadeb071] Remove support for HPPA (a/k/a PA-RISC) architecture.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     移除对<acronym>HPPA</acronym>/<acronym>PA-RISC</acronym>架构的支持（Tom Lane）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;edadeb071">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

   </sect3>

   <sect3 id="release-18-modules">
    <title>附加模块</title>

    <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Masahiko Sawada <msawada@postgresql.org>
2024-10-14 [7cdfeee32] Add contrib/pg_logicalinspect.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加扩展<xref linkend="pglogicalinspect"/>以检查逻辑快照（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7cdfeee32">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-03-26 [8d5ceb113] pg_overexplain: Additional EXPLAIN options for debugging
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加扩展<xref linkend="pgoverexplain"/>，它向<link linkend="sql-explain"><command>EXPLAIN</command></link>输出添加调试细节（Robert Haas）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;8d5ceb113">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-07-26 [c297a47c5] postgres_fdw: Add "used_in_xact" column to postgres_fdw_
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-07-26 [857df3cef] postgres_fdw: Add connection status check to postgres_fd
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-09-18 [4f08ab554] postgres_fdw: Extend postgres_fdw_get_connections to ret
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2025-03-03 [fe186bda7] postgres_fdw: Extend postgres_fdw_get_connections to ret
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     向<link
     linkend="postgres-fdw-functions"><function>postgres_fdw_get_connections()</function></link>添加输出列（Hayato Kuroda, Sagar Dilip Shedge）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c297a47c5">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;857df3cef">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4f08ab554">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;fe186bda7">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     新的输出列<structfield>used_in_xact</structfield>指示外部数据包装器是否正在被当前事务使用，<structfield>closed</structfield>指示它是否已关闭，<structfield>user_name</structfield>指示用户名，<structfield>remote_backend_pid</structfield>指示远程后端进程标识符。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-01-15 [761c79508] postgres_fdw: SCRAM authentication pass-through
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许将客户端的<link linkend="auth-password"><acronym>SCRAM</acronym></link>认证传递给<xref
     linkend="postgres-fdw"/>服务器（Matheus Alcantara, Peter Eisentraut）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;761c79508">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这避免了在数据库中存储<application>postgres_fdw</application>认证信息，并通过<application>postgres_fdw</application> <link
     linkend="postgres-fdw-option-use-scram-passthrough"><literal>use_scram_passthrough</literal></link>连接选项启用。libpq使用新的连接参数<xref linkend="libpq-connect-scram-client-key"/>和<xref
     linkend="libpq-connect-scram-server-key"/>。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Peter Eisentraut <peter@eisentraut.org>
2025-03-26 [3642df265] dblink: SCRAM authentication pass-through
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许将客户端的<acronym>SCRAM</acronym>认证传递给<xref linkend="dblink"/>服务器（Matheus Alcantara）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;3642df265">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-10-03 [a1c4c8a9e] file_fdw: Add on_error and log_verbosity options to file
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     为<xref linkend="file-fdw"/>添加<literal>on_error</literal>和<literal>log_verbosity</literal>选项（Atsushi Torikoshi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;a1c4c8a9e">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这些控制<application>file_fdw</application>如何处理和报告无效文件行。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Fujii Masao <fujii@postgresql.org>
2024-11-20 [6c8f67032] file_fdw: Add REJECT_LIMIT option to file_fdw.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加<literal>reject_limit</literal>以控制<application>file_fdw</application>可以忽略的无效行数（Atsushi Torikoshi）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6c8f67032">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这在<literal>ON_ERROR = 'ignore'</literal>时激活。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Nathan Bossart <nathan@postgresql.org>
2025-01-07 [f7e1b3828] Add passwordcheck.min_password_length.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     向<xref linkend="passwordcheck"/>添加可配置变量<varname>min_password_length</varname>（Emanuele Musella, Maurizio Boriani）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;f7e1b3828">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这控制最小密码长度。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tatsuo Ishii <ishii@postgresql.org>
2024-10-11 [cae0f3c40] pgbench: Improve result outputs related to failed transa
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     让<xref linkend="pgbench"/>在每脚本报告中报告失败、重试或跳过的事务数（Yugo Nagata）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cae0f3c40">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tom Lane <tgl@sss.pgh.pa.us>
2025-03-16 [448904423] contrib/isn: Make weak mode a GUC setting, and fix relat
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加<xref linkend="isn"/>服务器变量<literal>weak</literal>以控制是否接受无效的校验位（Viktor Holmberg）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;448904423">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     这以前仅由函数<link
     linkend="isn-functions"><function>isn_weak()</function></link>控制。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Heikki Linnakangas <heikki.linnakangas@iki.fi>
2025-04-03 [e4309f73f] Add support for sorted gist index builds to btree_gist
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许对值进行排序以加快<xref linkend="btree-gist"/>索引的构建（Bernd Helmle, Andrey Borodin）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;e4309f73f">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Tomas Vondra <tomas.vondra@postgresql.org>
2025-03-29 [14ffaece0] amcheck: Add gin_index_check() to verify GIN index
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加<xref linkend="amcheck"/>检查函数<link
     linkend="amcheck-functions"><function>gin_index_check()</function></link>以验证<literal>GIN</literal>索引（Grigory Kryachko, Heikki Linnakangas, Andrey Borodin）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;14ffaece0">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Andres Freund <andres@anarazel.de>
2025-04-08 [dcf7e1697] Add pg_buffercache_evict_{relation,all} functions
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     添加函数<link
     linkend="pgbuffercache-pg-buffercache-evict-relation"><function>pg_buffercache_evict_relation()</function></link>和<link
     linkend="pgbuffercache-pg-buffercache-evict-all"><function>pg_buffercache_evict_all()</function></link>以逐出未钉住的共享缓冲区（Nazir Bilal Yavuz）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dcf7e1697">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>

     <para>
     现有函数<link
     linkend="pgbuffercache-pg-buffercache-evict"><function>pg_buffercache_evict()</function></link>现在返回缓冲区刷新状态。
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-03-18 [c65bc2e1d] Make it possible for loadable modules to add EXPLAIN opt
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-03-18 [4fd02bf7c] Add some new hooks so extensions can add details to EXPL
Author: Robert Haas <rhaas@postgresql.org>
2025-03-20 [50ba65e73] Add an additional hook for EXPLAIN option validation.
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许扩展安装自定义的<xref linkend="sql-explain"/>选项（Robert Haas, Sami Imseih）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;c65bc2e1d">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;4fd02bf7c">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;50ba65e73">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-08-04 [7949d9594] Introduce pluggable APIs for Cumulative Statistics
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-08-05 [2eff9e678] Add helper routines to retrieve data for custom fixed-nu
-->

     <listitem>
     <para>
     允许扩展使用服务器的累计统计信息<acronym>API</acronym>（Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;7949d9594">&sect;</ulink> <ulink url="&commit_baseurl;2eff9e678">&sect;</ulink>
     </para>
     </listitem>

    </itemizedlist>

    <sect4 id="release-18-pgstatstatements">
     <title><xref linkend="pgstatstatements"/></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-10-28 [6b652e6ce] Set query ID for inner queries of CREATE TABLE AS and DE
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许<xref linkend="sql-createtableas"/>和<xref linkend="sql-declare"/>的查询被<application>pg_stat_statements</application>跟踪（Anthonin Bonnefoy）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;6b652e6ce">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      它们现在也被分配了查询ID。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-09-30 [dc6851596] Show values of SET statements as constants in pg_stat_st
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      允许在<application>pg_stat_statements</application>中对<xref linkend="sql-set"/>的值进行参数化（Greg Sabino Mullane, Michael Paquier）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;dc6851596">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这减少了由于具有不同常量的<command>SET</command>语句引起的数据膨胀。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2024-10-09 [cf54a2c00] pg_stat_statements: Add columns to track parallel worker
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<link
      linkend="pgstatstatements-pg-stat-statements"><structname>pg_stat_statements</structname></link>列以报告并行活动（Guillaume Lelarge）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;cf54a2c00">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      新列是 <structfield>parallel_workers_to_launch</structfield> 和 <structfield>parallel_workers_launched</structfield>。
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Michael Paquier <michael@paquier.xyz>
2025-02-17 [ce5bcc4a9] pg_stat_statements: Add wal_buffers_full
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<structname>pg_stat_statements</structname>.<structfield>wal_buffers_full</structfield>以报告满<acronym>WAL</acronym>缓冲区（Bertrand Drouvot）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;ce5bcc4a9">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>

    </sect4>

    <sect4 id="release-18-pgcrypto">
     <title><xref linkend="pgcrypto"/></title>

     <itemizedlist>

<!--
Author: Álvaro Herrera <alvherre@alvh.no-ip.org>
2025-04-05 [749a9e20c] Add modern SHA-2 based password hashes to pgcrypto.
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<application>pgcrypto</application>算法<link
      linkend="pgcrypto-crypt-algorithms"><literal>sha256crypt</literal></link>和<link
      linkend="pgcrypto-crypt-algorithms"><literal>sha512crypt</literal></link>（Bernd Helmle）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;749a9e20c">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-02-14 [9ad1b3d01] pgcrypto: Add support for CFB mode in AES encryption
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      为<application>pgcrypto</application>的加密和解密添加<link
      linkend="pgcrypto-raw-enc-funcs"><acronym>CFB</acronym></link>模式（Umar Hayat）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;9ad1b3d01">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-01-24 [924d89a35] pgcrypto: Add function to check FIPS mode
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加函数<link
      linkend="pgcrypto-openssl-support-funcs"><function>fips_mode()</function></link>以报告服务器的<acronym>FIPS</acronym>模式（Daniel Gustafsson）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;924d89a35">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>
      </listitem>

<!--
Author: Daniel Gustafsson <dgustafsson@postgresql.org>
2025-01-24 [035f99cbe] pgcrypto: Make it possible to disable built-in crypto
-->

      <listitem>
      <para>
      添加<application>pgcrypto</application>服务器变量<link
      linkend="pgcrypto-configuration-parameters-builtin_crypto_enabled"><varname>builtin_crypto_enabled</varname></link>以允许禁用内置非<acronym>FIPS</acronym>模式密码学函数（Daniel Gustafsson, Joe Conway）<ulink url="&commit_baseurl;035f99cbe">&sect;</ulink>
      </para>

      <para>
      这对于保证<acronym>FIPS</acronym>模式行为很有用。
      </para>
      </listitem>

     </itemizedlist>
    </sect4>

   </sect3>

  </sect2>

